<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Borna New Testamnet</book>
  <para style="h">Yohans Dooshishiyo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yohans Dooshishiyo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yohans Dooshishiyo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoh.</para>
  <para style="mt">Yohans Guut'tso</para>
  <para style="mt3">Nodoonz Iyesus Krstos Dooshishiyo</para>
  <para style="imt">Kindo</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohans dooshishiyo Iyesusi b́ t'intsir meetso tahdek't ash dagotse beyat beets Ik'i aap'o b́wottsok'owo kitsosha, mas'aafan b́tookon b́ kitsirwok'on dooshishiyan b́ guut'e bín nababirwots Iyesus kashitso wotar weetwe eteets Ik'o naayi b́wottsok'o amanar, bín boamantsatse tuutsonowere dúre dúri kasho bodetso bodanishe (20:31).</para>
  <para style="ip">B́ dooshishiyi tuwoki kayanitse dúre dúron Ik'o keewuts keewonat Iyesusn ik bowottsok'o kindok'o aridek't b́t'intsiyakon Iyesus kashitso wotaarr weetuwe eteets Ik'o naayi b́wottsok'owo kitsiru k'osh k'osh adits keewwotsi b́t'intsiri. Maniyere hakonowere aditsanotsatse eegi oot'o daatsetsok'o kitsiru taarikiwots b́shuutsats weyirune. B́kayaan b́kitsir ik ik ashuwots Iyesusn amanar b́shuuts sha'at biyatse dantswotsi bowottsok'o, k'oshwotswere ando awuk'on bín bok'eftsok'ona bín amaneratsone boettsok'oniye. K'ot 13-17 tse Iyesus b́detsewots kooc' b́ danifwotsnton awuk'o karnts gonkeyo detst b́teshtsok'onat b́ jiteyoniyere shin k'andek'ikonat kup'shit aap'i keewwotsi b́ shishitsok'oniye bokeewiri. S'uwaatsi k'ot'wots Iyesus b́detseyonat angshosh b́t'iini jango, b́jiitewonat k'irotse b́tuwi jango, aani k'irotse b́tuwi jango, mank'o k'irotse b́tuwiyako b́woshefwotsats b́be'etwok'o keewirwotsiye. Yohans Iyesus Krstos weeron daatset dúre dúri beyo p'aap'uridek't b́kitsir deeran andon tuur Iyesusi weerok'o, arook'o, kashok'o woshde dek'etwotsshe. Yohans doo shishiyo k'osh k'osh b́wotitwok'o k'altso shayiri keewwotsi kitsosh daneetswotsnat aaw aawi nobeyootse boon nofiinef (t'ak'amamefwotsi), man etonwere aatsok'o, mishok'o, sháánok'o, giz jinfonat mereerwotskok'o, weyini mitonat weyini shuwon arts keewwotsn b́guut'oniye.</para>
  <para style="iot">Jamon mas'aafan b́detstso</para>
  <para style="io1">Shin shino 1:1-18</para>
  <para style="io1">Yohans gupfonat Iyesus danif shintswotsna 1:19-51</para>
  <para style="io1">Iyesus b́fiino sháánon dek'b́tutsok'owo 2:1—12:50</para>
  <para style="io1">Iyerusalemnat bgúúratse b́fiini s'uwatse aawwotsí 13:1—19:42</para>
  <para style="io1">Doonzo k'irotse tuwonat b́be'ewo 20:1-31</para>
  <para style="io1">Gúúpo, Gelin ando aani b́woshefwots b́be'ewo 21:1-25</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1"/>
  <para style="s">Aap'o kash imts meets b́wottsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1"/>Shin shin aap'o fa'e b́tesh, aap'onwere Ik'oke b́ teshi, aap'manwere Ik'e b́ teshi. <verse eid="JHN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2"/>Bí shin shin Ik'ontoni b́ taash. <verse eid="JHN 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3"/>Jam keewo bína bí azee, azeets jamotse ikonwor bí bíazrawo azeetso aaliye. <verse eid="JHN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4"/>Bíyoknowere kasho fa'e b́ teshi, kashanwere ashuwotssh sháána b́ teshi. <verse eid="JHN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5"/>Shááno t'aluwats c'eeshitwe, t'alwonu shááno da'aratse.<verse eid="JHN 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:1">Mat. 3:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:4">Mar. 1:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-2">Luk'. 3:1-2</ref> </char>
    </note> Ik'oke wosheetso Yohanisi eteets ash iko fa'e b́ tesh. <verse eid="JHN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7"/>B́ gawts gawon jamo bíamanitwok'o bí shááni jangosh gaw wotat b́weyi. <verse eid="JHN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8"/>Bíwere shááni jangoni gawosh b́ weyi bako bí b́tookon sháánaliye. <verse eid="JHN 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9"/>Ash jamwotssh c'eshitwo ariko wottso shááno dats jamwats woke b́ fa'oni.<verse eid="JHN 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10"/>Bíwere datsanatse b́ teshi, datsanwere bí'azee bíne, datsanmó bín danatsane. <verse eid="JHN 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11"/>B́ik wottswotsok waare, b́ jirwotsmó bín de'atsne. <verse eid="JHN 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12"/>Wotowabako b́ keewu dek'tswotsnat b́ shútson amants jamwots Ik'o nana'uwotsi bowotitwok'owe alo boosh b́mi. <verse eid="JHN 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13"/>Bowere Ik'atse shuwekno bako ash naaratse, man etonwere meetsi shnunon wee nungshe mááts gonkewon shuweratsne.<verse eid="JHN 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14"/>Aap'onu meets wotere, s'aatonat arikono s'eent no dagotse beere, b́ nihoke waats ik s'uz na'o mangok'o wottso b́ mangonowere bek'rone. <verse eid="JHN 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15"/>Yohanswere «Ekeew taayere il weyirumań taayere shin fa'o b́teshtsotse taayere ayidek't bogfe etaat itsh tkeewtsoniye haniye,» ett kuhat b́keewi. <verse eid="JHN 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16"/>B́ s'eenatse no noúnets s'aatats s'aato dek'rone, <verse eid="JHN 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17"/>Nemo Muse weerone imeyi, s'aatonat aronmo Iyesus Krstos weerone b́ weyi. <verse eid="JHN 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18"/>B́jamon Ik' bek'tso konwor aaliye, wotowa eree Ik'o niho sheetsotse fa'a ik s'uzo b́naayi, bíwere Ik'wottsoni noosh kish kitsiye.<verse eid="JHN 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gpfo Yohans gawts gawo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat. 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mar. 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk'. 3:1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19"/>Ayhudi naashwots Iyersalemitsi kahniwotsnat Lewawino etefwotsn Yohansok woshat, «Kone nee?» ett boatiyor b́ imts gawo hank'oyiye.<verse eid="JHN 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20"/>Bí «Taa Krstos taanaliye» et b́ gawi bako gawo gawosh k'aze eraatse.<verse eid="JHN 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:21 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="DEU 18:15">Iwi. 18:15</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 18:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 4:5">Mil. 4:5</ref> </char>
    </note> Bowere «Beree nee kone? Eliyas neeneya?» ett bín boaati.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Bíwere «Taanaliye» ett boosh bíaniyi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Bowere «Weetwe eteetso nebiyiwo neeneya?» bo et.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Bíwere «bí taanaliye» bí eti. <verse eid="JHN 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22"/>Bowere «Beree konene? Noon woshetsuwotssh nokeewish n took jangosh aawk'owe nieteti?» bo eti. <verse eid="JHN 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Isa. 40:3</ref> </char></note> Bíwere «Nebiywo Isayas b́ keewtsok'on</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:23">Taa ‹Doonzo weero katsuwre› et fere</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 1:23">worotse kuhiru asho k'aaro taane» bí eti.<verse eid="JHN 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24"/>Ashuwotswere bo woshe ferisawiwotsi etefuwotsitsna botesh, <verse eid="JHN 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25"/>Beree, «Nee Krstosi wee Eliyasi wee weetwe eteets nebiyo woto nk'azihakon eegoshe n gupiri?» ett bínboaati.<verse eid="JHN 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26"/>Yohansuwere hank'o ett boosh bíaaniy, «Taa tgupirye aatsone, eree it it danawo it dagotse b́ ned'iriye. <verse eid="JHN 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27"/>Bí taayere ile b́ weetiye, taa b́ c'aami tipi joko bitsosh dab bodktanaliye.»<verse eid="JHN 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28"/>Man b́ wotwere Yohans b́ gupfoke Yordanos fokoniyere bak'etse Betani kitotsna b́tesh.<verse eid="JHN 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ik'i mereero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29"/>Yatsok'on Yohans Iyesusi b́ maants b́waafere bek't hank'o bíet «Datsantsi morro k'aa'ubazetwo Ik'i mereero haniye! <verse eid="JHN 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30"/>‹T shutsatse weyiru ekeew taayere shino b́ teshtsotse taayere ayidek't bogfe› ti ettsoniye haniye. <verse eid="JHN 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31"/>Taawor ttookish bín danaaktana b́tesh, ernmó Isra'el ashuwotssh b́ be'eyish taa aatson gupfere t weyi. <verse eid="JHN 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32"/>Manats dabt Yohans hank'o ett gawere S'ayin shayiro erkukundok'o darotse oot't biyats b́ k'ot'efre t bek'i. <verse eid="JHN 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33"/>Taawor bín danaktane, ernmó aatson tgupetwok'o taan woshtsoniye, ‹Shayiro ood'r bíats b́ beewor n bek'etwo S'ayin shayiron gupetwo bíne› ett taash keewi. <verse eid="JHN 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34"/>Tawor han bek're, bí Ik'o naayi b́wottsok'owo gawitwe.»<verse eid="JHN 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus b́danif shintsuwots</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35"/>Yatsok'on Yohans b́ danif gitetswotsnton aani manoke need'dek'tni b́ tesh, <verse eid="JHN 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36"/>Yohans Iyesus man weeron b́beshefere bek't, «Hambe! Ik'oko mereroni!» bí et.<verse eid="JHN 1:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37"/>Yohans danif gitetswots Yohans man b́ keewfere shisht Iyesus shutsats shoydek't bo ami. <verse eid="JHN 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38"/>Iyesus wongr et aanat s'ilbek't, «Eebi it geyiri?» bíet.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:38">Bowere, «Rebi! eewke n beefoni?» boet. (rebi etoni danifino eta.)<verse eid="JHN 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39"/>Bíwere, «Waa s'iilere» bí eti. Eshe amt aak b́byirwok'o bos'ili. Manots aawots bínton towat bojin, manwere aaw tatsi sa'atok'oyi b́tesh.<verse eid="JHN 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40"/>Yohans b́ keewts keewo shisht Iyesus shuuts amts b́ danif gitetswotsitse iko Simon P'et'ros eshu Indriyasi b́teshi. <verse eid="JHN 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41"/>Indriyas shin shino b́ eshu Sim'onok amt «Mesihiyo daatsdek'rone» bí et. (mesihiya eto Krstosi eta, wee fuuteka eta) <verse eid="JHN 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42"/>Maniye il Indriyas Sim'oni Iyesusok dek't b́weyi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:42">Iyesuswere t'iwintsdek't s'iilt, «Nee Yona naay Simon neene, haniye hakonmo Keefi eteyar s'egetune» bíet. (Keefi etonmu: P'et'rosi wee shútsi s'ala etee).<verse eid="JHN 1:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus Flip'osnat Natnaeln b́s'eegtsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43"/>Yatsok'on Iyesus Gelilmants amo b́gee, Flip'osi daatsdek't, «T shuutso shoy de wowe» bí eti. <verse eid="JHN 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44"/>Flip'os Indriyasnat P'et'rosnkok'o Bete Sayda eteets kitutsi asha b́tesh. <verse eid="JHN 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45"/>Filip'os Natna'eli daatsdek't, «Muse nemi mas'afatse, nebiyiwots bek'i mas'afatse b́ jangosh bo guut'tso daatsdek'rone, bíwere Yosef naay Nazrettso Iyesusiye» bí et. <verse eid="JHN 1:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46"/>Natnaelmó, «Nazretitse sheeng keewo b́jamon daatsewo falitwa k'úúna?» bí eti. Filp'osuwere «Waar s'iile!» bíet. <verse eid="JHN 1:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47"/>Natnael b́ maants b́waafere bek't Iyesus «Hambe! gond fino bíatse datserawo ariko Isra'el ashoni!» ett b́jangosh b́keewi. <verse eid="JHN 1:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48"/>Natnaeluwere «Aawokneya taan ndani?» bíet. Iyesuswere «Filip'os neenbs'egfetsere shino Belesi mitú shirotse n befere neen bek're» ett bísh bíaniyi. <verse eid="JHN 1:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49"/>Manoor Natna'el, «Danifono! nee Ik'o naay neene! nee Isra'el naasho neene!» bí et.<verse eid="JHN 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50"/>Iyesusu hank'owa bíet, «Nee ni aman, ‹Belesi mitu shirotse n befere neen bek're› ti ettsosheya? Haniye bogts keewwotsi shinomaants bek'etune. <verse eid="JHN 1:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:51 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 28:12">Aze. 28:12</ref> </char></note> Arikoniye neesh tkeewiri, Daro b́k'eshere melkiwots ashna'o ats keer bo'ot'fere bek'etute.»<verse eid="JHN 1:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2"/>
  <para style="s">K'ana Zegelil eteets datsatse jiwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1"/>Keezl aawots Gelil datsatse fa'a K'aana eteef kittutse jiwo fa'e b́tesh, Iyesus induwere manokna btesh. <verse eid="JHN 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2"/>Mank'o Iyesusnat b́danifuwotswor jiwok s'egerno. <verse eid="JHN 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3"/>Jiwumanatsnowere weyniwon dutsets biro b́s'utsok'on Iyesus ind Iyesussh, «Weyini bironiye boshirotse s'uure!» biet. <verse eid="JHN 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4"/>Iyesuswere «Nee máátsune! eegishe t keewots n kindiri? Ti aawo borafa'ee» bí et.<verse eid="JHN 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5"/>Manoor b́ ind manoke fa'uwotssh, «Bí itsh b́ ettso k'alwere» bí eti.<verse eid="JHN 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6"/>Bonemok'on ayhudiwots bo s'ayinf niwa b́ teshtsotse shirt shútsi kunduwots manoke fa'ano, kunduwtsuwere bo ik ikets wee gito wee keez kor atso detso falitkno. <verse eid="JHN 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7"/>Iyesus guutswotssh «Kundwotsits atso s'eentswere» bí et, boowere bo nonots b́ borfestsosh s'eentsbok'ri. <verse eid="JHN 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8"/>Maniye hakon Iyesus guutsuwotssh, «Ereer eshe and! jiwo doonzsh tepde'er imere» bí et, boowere dek'amt bísh boimi. <verse eid="JHN 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9"/>Jiwo doonz weyini biro maants wonets aatso b́ nonots b́gedtsok'on, ewuke b́waatsok'o danatse, ernmó aats kitts guutsuwots danfno, jiwo doonz, guuyo s'eegdek't hank'o bíet, <verse eid="JHN 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10"/>«Ash na'i nemok'on ash jamo shin biri komo shin imr s'eegets asho b́ woriyakon il c'ic'o b́ t'intsfoni, nemon weyini biro sheengo andish b́ borfetso nbeezi.»<verse eid="JHN 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11"/>Iyesus adits jam keewwotsitsi shints wotts han Gelil dats kitu K'anitse b́ fini, eshe mank'oon b́mango b kitsi, b́ danifwotswere bín boamani.<verse eid="JHN 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 4:13">Mat. 4:13</ref> </char>
    </note> Maniye hakon b́ indnat b́ eshwotsnton, b́ danifuwotsnton K'frnahom maants b́o oot'i, ernmó manoke ay aawo teyatsno.<verse eid="JHN 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus Ik' mootse keewirwotsnat kemiruwotsi b́kishtsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Mat. 21:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Mar. 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luk'. 19:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13"/>Ayhudiwots fazigi baaliyo b́ bodtsotse Iyesus Iyerusalem maantsan bíami, <verse eid="JHN 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14"/>Ik' mootse minzwotsi, mererwotsnat kurkund kemirwotsnat gizo wonirwotsi bedek't bokeewefero bokeemfero boon b́ daatsi. <verse eid="JHN 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15"/>Manoor joki k'ac'eyo dooz dekt ash jamwotsi, bo mereruwotsnat bo minzwotsnton Ik' móótse b́ kish, bogizo wonirwots giz mano b́ bad'iyi, bomarono b́ gup'shi. <verse eid="JHN 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16"/>Kurkund kemiru ashuwotssho «Jaman okaan de'e ameree! t nih móó jaaki móó wosh k'ayere!» bíet. <verse eid="JHN 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 69:9">Dub. 69:9</ref> </char></note> Manoor b́ danifwots, «N maa jangosh okooro tawok'o taan mitsre» ett guut'etso gaw bodek'i.<verse eid="JHN 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18"/>Maniye hakon Ayhudi naash naashuwots Iyesusi, «Nee hank'o k'alosh alo n detstsok'osh n kitsit adits keewo eebi noosh n kitsiti?» boet.<verse eid="JHN 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:61">Mat. 26:61</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:40">27:40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:48">Mar. 14:48</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:29">15:29</ref> </char>
    </note> Iyesuswere, «Ik' man gah k'rore taa keez aawotse aaniy aak'ritwe» bí et.<verse eid="JHN 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20"/>Bowere, «Ik' maan agosh habe shrt nato ishre, Eshe nee keez aawotse aanik'riti?» boeti. <verse eid="JHN 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21"/>Iyesusmó «Ik' maa» ett b́ keewtso bí atsi janga b́ tesh. <verse eid="JHN 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22"/>Manatse tuutson Iyesus k'irotse b́ tuutsok'on b́ danifwots man keewt b́teshtsok'o gawbodek', mann S'ayin mas'aafotse guut'etsonat Iyesus b́ keewts keewo bo amani.<verse eid="JHN 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23"/>Ieyesus Fazig baliwor Iyerusalemitse b́bewor b́ finits adits keewwotsi bobek'tsotse ay ashuwots bin boamani. <verse eid="JHN 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24"/>Iyesusmó ash jamwotsi b́ dantsotse boon amaneratse, <verse eid="JHN 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25"/>Bí ash nibotse fa'a jamo b́ dantsosh ash jango konwor bísh b́ keewitwok'o geeraka.<verse eid="JHN 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3"/>
  <para style="s">Nik'odimos aashon Iyesusok b́waatsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1"/>Nik'odimosi eteets ash iko fa'e b́tesh, bíewere ferisawino eteef́wts jirwotts Ayhudi naasha b́tesh. <verse eid="JHN 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2"/>Ashaan t'úwon Iyesusok waat, «Danifono, Ik'o bínton b́wotiyala bako nee n k'aliru adits keewanotsi k'alosh falituwo konuwor aaliye, manshe nee Ik'oke waats danifo nwottsok'o danfone» bí et.<verse eid="JHN 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3"/>Iyesuswere, «Arikon arikoniye itsh keewirwe, asho aani gitlo shuweratse wotiyal Ik'i mengsto bek'osh falratse» bíet.<verse eid="JHN 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4"/>Nik'odimoswere, «Eshe, asho bí enashiyakon awuk'o k'alrniya b́ shuweti? Gitlo indumac'ots kindrniya shuweyo b́ falitik'úna?» eton bíaati.<verse eid="JHN 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5"/>Iyesuswere hank'o ett bíaaniy, «Ariko, arikoniye neesh t keewiri, asho Shayronat aatson b́shuweyala bako Ik'i mengstots kindo falratse. <verse eid="JHN 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6"/>Meetsatse shuwetso meetse, Shayiron shuwetsonmo Shayire. <verse eid="JHN 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7"/>Mansha ‹Gitlo shuwewo itsh geyife› neesh tiettsotse adk'aye. <verse eid="JHN 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8"/>Jongo b́shuntso mande b́jongefoni, b́ k'arono shishetwone, ernmó aawoke b́weyirwok'onat aawok bíamiruwok'o danatsne, mank'o shayirats shuwets jamo mank'oyiye.»<verse eid="JHN 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9"/>Nik'odimosuwere, «Aawuk'oneya hank'o woto b́faliti?» ett bíaati.<verse eid="JHN 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10"/>Iyesuswere hank'o ett bísh bíaniyi, «Nee Isra'elsh danifo wotefetsat han danafa'i? <verse eid="JHN 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11"/>Ariko arikoniye neesh tietiry, nodantso keewirwone, no bek'tsonowere gawirwone, itmó no gawts gawo de'atste. <verse eid="JHN 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12"/>Datsatsi keewo itsh tkeewor amaneratste wotiyal daratsi keewo itsh t keewor aawk'oneya it amaniti? <verse eid="JHN 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13"/>Darotse oot'ts ash na'oniye okoon daromaand keshtso konwor aaliye.<verse eid="JHN 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="NUM 21:9">Taaw. 21:9</ref> </char>
    </note> «Muse worwotse dawunzo dambaan k'aaúdek't b́ jittsok'o mank'o ashna'o dambaan tuuzde'er bín jiito geyife. <verse eid="JHN 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15"/>Han b́wotirwonwere bín amants jametswots dúre dúri beyo bo datsitwok'owe.<verse eid="JHN 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16"/>«Bín amanit jametswots dúre dúri beyo b́ daatsituwok'owa bako b́ t'afrawok'o Ik'o datsu ayidek't b́shuntsotse ik s'uzo b́naayi b́ imi. <verse eid="JHN 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17"/>Ik'o b́naayi datsats b́ wosh, datso b́naayn b́ kashitwok'owa bako datsuwats b́ angshishaliye.<verse eid="JHN 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18"/>«Bín amantso ats angsheratse, bín amanerawonmó ik s'uz Ik' na'o shútson amano b́ k'aztsosh shinor bíats angshk'reke. <verse eid="JHN 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19"/>Angshonúwere haniye, shááno datsats waare, ashuwotsmó bo fino gond b́ wottsotse sháánoniyere t'aluwo boshuni. <verse eid="JHN 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20"/>Gond fin fints jamo shááno shunaka, b́ gond fino b́be'erawok'o sháánomand warake. <verse eid="JHN 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21"/>Arik wotts keewo finirúwonmó sháánomanda b́ waafo, shááno maants b́weyiruwere b́o fints keewo Ik'i alok'on b́ wottse sháánatse b́ be'etwok'owa.»<verse eid="JHN 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gupfo Yohans Iyesus jangosh b́gawtsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22"/>Maniye hakon Iyesus b́ danifwotsnton Yihud datsomand bíami, manoknowere gupfetst bonton muk'i b́ teshi. <verse eid="JHN 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23"/>Manoor Yohanswere aats ayi beyoke Salem ganoke Henoni eteets beyoke b́gupfera b́tesh, ashuwotswere waatni bo gupefo. <verse eid="JHN 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:24 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 14:3">Mat. 14:3</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:17">Mar. 6:17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:19-20">Luk'. 3:19-20</ref> </char></note> Manoor Yohans tiperafa'e b́tesh.<verse eid="JHN 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25"/>Manoor Yohans danifuwotsnat ayhudi iko dagotse nemok'on s'ayini jango moosho tuu b́gutsi. <verse eid="JHN 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26"/>Yohans danifuwots Yohans maants t'int «Danifono! andi Yordanosiye bak'etse neenton teshtso, nee b́ jangosh n gawtso, hambe! bíwere gupe b́gupiri, ash jametsutswere b́ maants amirune» boeti.<verse eid="JHN 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27"/>Yohans hank'owa ett bíaaniy, «Ik'o bísh b́ imala bako konwor b́wotiyal asho eegor dek'o falratse, <verse eid="JHN 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:28 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 1:20">Yoh. 1:20</ref> </char></note> ‹B́ shin shinatsna taan wosheyi bako, taa Krstostanaliye› etaat tkeewtsok'osh it it tookonor gawu itne. <verse eid="JHN 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29"/>Guyu mootse detsts ashoniye guyee, ernmó guuyo mashiye guuyo ganoke ned'deniye bín b́k'ebetiye, b́ k'aaro shishono gene'úwitwe, manshe t gene'oniye haniye, bíwere and s'eengutserere. <verse eid="JHN 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30"/>Bí dambaan dambaan eto bísh geyife, taamo dashan dashan eto taash geyife.»<verse eid="JHN 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31"/>Dambe weetwo jametsoniyere boge, daatse wottso datsike, b́ keewirwonwere dastatsi keewe, darotse watso jamoniyere dambe. <verse eid="JHN 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32"/>Bí b́bek'tsonat b́ shishtsone b́gawitiye, errnmó b́ gawuts gawo dek'etwo aaliye. <verse eid="JHN 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33"/>B́ gawts gawo dek'etwonmó Ik'o arik b́ wottsok'o daniytwe. <verse eid="JHN 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34"/>Ik'o b́ S'ayin shayiro b́ imfo tatsde b́ woterawotse Ik'i woshtso Ik'i aap'o keewitwe.<verse eid="JHN 3:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:35 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 11:27">Mat. 11:27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:22">Luk'. 10:22</ref> </char>
    </note> Ik'o niho b́ naayi shunfee, jam keewonowere b́ naaysh kishots imk'rere. <verse eid="JHN 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36"/>Nayon amantso dúredúr kasho detsfe, naayo n amanerawonmó Ik'i fayo bíatse b́wotiti bako kasho daatsratse.<verse eid="JHN 3:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesusnat Semari datsatsi mááts ikún</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1"/>Manoor Iyesus Yohansiyere bogo ay ashuwotsi b́ danifwotsi b́ woshirwok'onat b́ gupirwok'o ferisawino etfwots shishbok'ri, <verse eid="JHN 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2"/>Wotowaere gupirwots b́ danifuwotsi bako bí b́tookon gufatse. <verse eid="JHN 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3"/>B́ jango keewetso ferisawiwots boshishtsok'o danb́k'rtsok'on Iyesus Yhud datso k'azt Gelil maants aani k'az bíam. <verse eid="JHN 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4"/>Manokowere bíamor Semari weeron besho bín geyika b́tesh.<verse eid="JHN 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="GEN 33:19">Aze. 33:19</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:32">Iya. 24:32</ref> </char>
    </note> Mansh Ya'ak'ob b́naaysh Yosefsh b́ imts beyoku ganoke fa'u, Sikari ett s'egefu Semariy kituts b́weyi. <verse eid="JHN 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6"/>Manoknowere Yak'ob aats gop'o fa'e b́tesh, Iyesus werind sha'oke b́ mááwtsotse gop'man ganok beeb́dek'i, manoor gizewonwere shrt sa'atok'owi b́tesh. <verse eid="JHN 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7"/>Manoor Semariy datsatsik wotts mááts iku aats kito gop'ok bweyi, Iyesuswere, «Úshet aatso taash ime!» bí eti <verse eid="JHN 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8"/>Manoor b́ danifwots mish keewosh kito maand amtnibofa'o. <verse eid="JHN 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EZR 4:1-5">Izr. 4:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 4:12">Neh. 4:12</ref> </char></note> Semari dats ash wotts ashmanwere Iyesussh, «Nee n naaro ayhudi wotefetsat aawk'oneya tnaaro Semari wottsush ‹Úshi aatso taash ime!› etaat niatiri?» bí et, man bíetwere ayhudiwots Samrawino etefwotsnton ik woto bodeshawotsna.<verse eid="JHN 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10"/>Iyesuswere, «Ik'i imonat ‹Úshet aatso taash ime!› neesh etirwo koni b́wotstsok'o ndanink'e, bín k'oniyank'u neene bteshi, bíwere kash aatso neesh imank'e» bíet.<verse eid="JHN 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11"/>Biwere hank'o etaat biaaniyi, «Doonzono! neewo bín kitet k'ac'o deshatsnere, gop'onuwere ayi dashan woke, eshe kash aatso eewkneya n datsiti? <verse eid="JHN 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12"/>Nee gop'an imtso nonih Yak'obiyere bogfiya? Bína ett b́ nana'on, b́ minzwotswere gop'anitse úshrnee.»<verse eid="JHN 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13"/>Iyesus hank'o ettni bish bíaaniy, «Aatshan úshetu jamo ando aaniy shashwitwee, <verse eid="JHN 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14"/>Taa timet aatso úshetwonmo dúre dúrosh b́ jamon shashweratse, taa ti imet aatso dúre dúrosh kasho bítse t'up'et aatse b́ wotiti.»<verse eid="JHN 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15"/>Máátsmanwere, «Doonzono! haniye hakon aatso taan b́shashwirawok'o aaninwere kitosh hanok twarawok'o oona neesha man naari aatso taash ime!» bí et.<verse eid="JHN 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16"/>Iyesuswere, «Amr n kenihi s'eede aniwowe» bíet.<verse eid="JHN 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17"/>Ashmanwere, «Keniho deshatse» etaat bíaaniy.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:17">Manoor Iyesus hank'owa bish bíet, «Keniho deshatse niettsoniye arikee, <verse eid="JHN 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18"/>Uts kenihwotsi detsfne b́teshi, and neenton fa'a ashonwere n kenihiyaliye, manshe ariko keewurne» bí eti.<verse eid="JHN 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19"/>Máátsmanwe hank'o bísh bíet, «Doonzono! nee nebiyiyo nwottsok'o andee t dani, <verse eid="JHN 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20"/>Nonihots guranatsene Ik'o bok'ofoni, itmó ‹Ashuwots Ik'o k'ono boosh b́ geyitiye Iyerusalemitsne› etfte.»<verse eid="JHN 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21"/>Iyesuswere hank'wa bish bíet, «Nee ashune! Guranatse wee Iyerusalemitse Ik'o nihosh sagado it k'azet aawo b́ weetwok'oyish taan amanowe, <verse eid="JHN 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22"/>It it daanawoshe it sagadiri, noomo kashet weero b́weet ayhudiwotsoke b́wottsotse no dants Ik'oshe nosagadiri. <verse eid="JHN 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23"/>Ernmó arikon Ik'osh sagadirwots, Ik'o nihosh arikonat Shayirn bosagadit aawo weetwe, dab andoor waare, Ik'o nihonwere b́geyirwo hank'on bísh sagaditwotsiye. <verse eid="JHN 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24"/>Ik'o shayire, bísh sagadirwotswere shayironat arikon sagado boosh geyife.»<verse eid="JHN 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25"/>Máátsmanwere «Krstosi eteetso Mesihiyo b́weetuwok'o danfee, bí b́ woor jam keewo noosh keewitwe» bi et.<verse eid="JHN 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26"/>Iyesuswere «Hamb! and neenton keeweyirwo taahe bíne» bí et.<verse eid="JHN 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27"/>Manoor b́ danifwots bo amtsoke aanat boweyi, Iyesus máátsunton b́ keeweyirwotse bo adi, wotowa bako, «Eege ngeyiri? Wee binton eegishe n keeweyiri?» ett bín attso konwor aali b́ tesh.<verse eid="JHN 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28"/>Maniye hakon máátsman b koro k'azk'rat́ kito maants amat́ ash ashosh hank'o bieti, <verse eid="JHN 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29"/>«T k'alts jamó taash keewts asho waar s'iilere! daneraka biye Krstosi wotifek'úna?» <verse eid="JHN 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30"/>Ashuwotswere kitotse kesht Iyesus maants boami.<verse eid="JHN 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31"/>Manoor b́ danifwots Iyesussh, «Danifonó! ik jago mishok'o moowe» ett bok'oni.<verse eid="JHN 4:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32"/>Bimó, «It danawo taa t meyiru móó detsfe» bíet.<verse eid="JHN 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33"/>Mansh b́ danifwots, «Asho bísh misho dek'waatso fa'ak'úna?» bo eti. <verse eid="JHN 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34"/>Iyesuswere boosh hank'owo bí et, «Tiko mishoniye taan woshtso ettso k'alona ett b́ finono s'eentsone. <verse eid="JHN 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35"/>It ‹Haniyak awd shasho orere, maniye hakone maay k'ees'o b́bodeti› etirutosha? Taamó ‹Aab kaaw de'er mááykatswots k'es'osh bobodtsok'o s'iilere› etirwe itsha. <verse eid="JHN 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36"/>K'es'irwo bí angi k'awntso dek'etwe, dúre dúri bewosh wotit shuwo ko'itwe, mansha shokirwonat, k'es'irwonton tohar gene'uwitúne. <verse eid="JHN 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37"/>Hnk'o b́ wottsotse ‹Iko shoketwe, k'osho k'es'etwe› eteetso arikee. <verse eid="JHN 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38"/>Taawere it bíats it shamberawo it k'es'etwok'o itn woshere, k'oshwots finon bomaawi, itmo bomawtsatse shuwo it meyi.» <verse eid="JHN 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39"/>Máátsunwere «T k'alts jamo taash keewure» etaat b gawtsok'on kit manitsere ankat Samari dats ashuwots bín bo amani. <verse eid="JHN 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40"/>Samari datsatsi ashuwots Iyesusok bo waatsok'on bonton b́ beetuewk'o bok'oni, bíwere git aawo manoke b́ teshi. <verse eid="JHN 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41"/>Bí aap'atse tuutsatse k'osh ankat ashonwere bín bo amani. <verse eid="JHN 4:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42"/>Ashmanshowere «Hniye hakon bín no amanitiye nee noosh n keewtsoshaliye no notookon noshishtsonat arikon datsani kashitwo bín b́wottsok'o no dantsotsne.» boeti.<verse eid="JHN 4:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus naasho na'o b́kashitsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43"/>Iyesus Semariy datsatse git aawo b́ teshihakon Gelil datso maantsan bíami. <verse eid="JHN 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:44 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 13:57">Mat. 13:57</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:4">Mar. 6:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:24">Luk'. 4:24</ref> </char></note> Bí b́ tookon «Nebiyiwo b́ took datsatse mangiyerakee» ett keewre b́tesh. <verse eid="JHN 4:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:45 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 2:23">Yoh. 2:23</ref> </char></note> Gelil maants b́bodtsok'onmó Gelil dats ashuwots mangon bín bodek'i, han b́wotwere Fazig baliwots Iyerusalem maants amt boteshor bi manoke b́ k'alts jamo bek't boteshtsotsná.<verse eid="JHN 4:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:46 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="JHN 2:1-11">Yoh. 2:1-11</ref> </char>
    </note> Maniye hakon Iyesus aatso weyini biro maants b́wonits datsu Gelil datsatse fa'a K'aan kitu maants aani aanat b́weyi, manoor K'frnahomn b́ na'o b́shirotse shodtso mengsti mootse naash iko fa'e b́ tesh. <verse eid="JHN 4:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47"/>Bíwere Iyesus Yihud datsatse Gelil datsats b́wowo shisht b́ maants bíam, K'frnahom maants ood'r ayidek't shodt k'irosh etirwo b́ na'o bísh b́kashiytwok'o Iyesusi b́k'oni. <verse eid="JHN 4:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48"/>Iyesuswere «It adits keewonat milikito it bek'ala bako eegonor amaneratste!» bíet. <verse eid="JHN 4:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49"/>Naashmanúwere «Doonzono! t na'o b́ k'irftsre oona neesha kaari ood'e» bíet.<verse eid="JHN 4:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50"/>Iyesuswere «N moo maants amee! n na'o kashon fa'e» bíet.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:50">Ashmanwere Iyesus aap'tso amanat b́ moo maants bíami. <verse eid="JHN 4:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51"/>Bíamfere b́guutswots weerindatse daatsdek't «N na'o kashwtsere» ett bísh keew bok'ri.<verse eid="JHN 4:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52"/>Bíwere b́ na'o b́ shamp'ts sa'ato boon bíaati. Bowere «Oots shawat sa'atatse atsik'es'o bínfakshb́k'riye» boet. <verse eid="JHN 4:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53"/>Nihonwere, Iyesus «N na'o kashon fa'e» bíettso manoori sa'aton b́wottsok'owo danb́k'r, mansh manots aawon detst bínat b́maa ashon Iyesusi aman bok'ri.<verse eid="JHN 4:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54"/>Aditshan Iyesus Yhud datsatse Gelil datsomants waat b́k'alts gitloniye.<verse eid="JHN 4:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesus ash dúr iko b́kashitsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1"/>Maniye hakon ayhudiwots worowoti bali aaw b́ wottsotse Iyesus Iyerusalem maants bíami. <verse eid="JHN 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2"/>Iyerusalemn mererwots fengeshi ganoke, Ibrayist'i noonon Betezata eteets ikok kakts atso fa'e b́tesh, b́gúratsnowere bí tookatse ipdetsts boweeron besheefwots fa'ano botesh. <verse eid="JHN 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3"/>Ayidek't ay shodetswots, aaw dogwots, duruwotsnat shoklirwots b́ beshiru werats k'edek'tni botesh.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="ft">Yoots kishon guut'ets mas'afwots taaw 3 s'watsere tuur taaw 4 s'uwaats b́borfetso dabrakno. </char></note> Ashmanots aatsman b́ giwoni bokotfo botesh, <verse eid="JHN 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4"/>Besh beshr Doonzo melakiyo aats kakots ood'r aatsman b́ giwshfoni, aats giwmaniye okoon shino aats kakmanits kindtso b́ shodts shodinar jamatse kashefe b́ tesh. <verse eid="JHN 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5"/>Manoknowere shaashe shimt nat jamosh shodts ash iko fa'e b́tesh. <verse eid="JHN 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6"/>Iyesus ashman manoke b́ k'eefere bek't ayduroniye shintson b́shodok'o dant, «Kasho geefi?» bíet.<verse eid="JHN 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7"/>Shodetsonuwere «Doonzono! aatso b́ giwtsok'on taan de'amr aats kakmanits gedet asho deshatse, taa amoosh tietor k'osh asho taayere shino oot'b́wtsiriye» bíet.<verse eid="JHN 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8"/>Iyesuswere «Tuuwe! ni es'o kurde'er amee!» bíet. <verse eid="JHN 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9"/>Ashmanwere manoor kashb́gutsi, b́ es'onowere kurdek't bíami.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Han b́wotwere sanbati aawone. <verse eid="JHN 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="NEH 13:19">Neh. 13:19</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:21">Erm. 17:21</ref> </char></note> Mansh Ayhudi naash naashuwots kashts ashmansh «Hambets sanbat b́wottsotse ni es'o nkuritwok'o neesh eekeratse» boet.<verse eid="JHN 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11"/>Bímó, «Taan kashits asho ‹nies'o kurde'e amee› ett taash keewre» bíet.<verse eid="JHN 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12"/>Bowere, «Ni es'o kurde' amee neesh ettso kone bí?» ett bo aati.<verse eid="JHN 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13"/>Ashmanmó ashasho bí aytsotsnat Iyesus manoke okaan t'iindek't b́teshtsotse bín kashitso koni b́wottsok'o danatse b́tesh.<verse eid="JHN 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14"/>Maniye hakon Iyesus ashman Ik' mootse daatsdek't, «Hamb, and kasherne, haniye bog keewo niats b́borawok'o haniye hakon morro fink'aye» bíet.<verse eid="JHN 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15"/>Ashmanwere amt bín kashitso Iyesusi b́wottsok'o ayhudiyi naashwotssh keewb́k'ri. <verse eid="JHN 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16"/>Keew man sanbati aawots b́ fintsotse Ayhudi naashwots Iyesusi gisho dek't botwi.<verse eid="JHN 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17"/>Iyesusmó «T nih andish b́borfetso fine b́finiri, taawere finirwe» ett boosh bíaaniy.<verse eid="JHN 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18"/>Man boshishtsosh Ayhudi naashuwots Iyesusi boúd'itwok'o iki boon tuzb́k'ri, man b́wotu bíye sanbato b́gaaktso s'uzsh b́ woterawo, «Ik'o t nihiye» eton b́ tooko Ik'onton b́nutsitsoshe.<verse eid="JHN 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ik'o naay detsts alo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19"/>Iyesus hank'o ett boosh bíaaniy, «Arikon arkoniye itsh ti etiriye, Niho b́ finefere b́bek'tso finoniye okoon naayo b́took alon eegor fino falratse. Niho b́ k'alirwok'o naayonwere b́ k'aliri. <verse eid="JHN 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20"/>Niho naayo b́shuntsosh b́ finiru jamo bísh kitsitwe, itwere it aditwok'o haniye bog finonor bísh kitsitwe. <verse eid="JHN 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21"/>Niho k'irtsuwotsi b́ tuuzituwok'onat kashonowere boosh b́imetuwok'owa, naayonúwe mankowa b́ shunts ashosh kasho b́ imeti. <verse eid="JHN 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22"/>Niho konatsor angshratse, ernmó angsh jamo naayosh imk'rere. <verse eid="JHN 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23"/>Hanowere b́ k'alir ash jamwots niho bomangitwok'o, aaninwere naayo no bomangitwok'owa, naayo mangirawo, naayman woshts niho mangiratse.<verse eid="JHN 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24"/>«Ariko aroniye itsh tietiri, t aap'tso k'ewur taan woshtsono amanitwo dúre dúri beyo detsfe, bíye k'irotse kashomand k'az b́ kimtsotse bíats angsheratse. <verse eid="JHN 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25"/>Ariko arikoniye itsh keewirwe, k'irts ashuwots Ik'o naay k'aaro boshishet aawo fa'e, b́dúronúwere andee, bín shishetu jamwotswere kashon beetune. <verse eid="JHN 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26"/>Niho b́tookon kash t'uup'o b́wottsotse, b́naaywere kash t'uup'o b́wotitwok'o woshre. <verse eid="JHN 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27"/>Ashna'a b́ wottsotsnowere angsho bíangshitwok'o alo bísh imre. <verse eid="JHN 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28"/>Keewan jangatse adk'ayere, dowootse fa'a jametswots b́ k'ááro boshishet aawo weetwe. <verse eid="JHN 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:29 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DAN 12:2">Dan. 12:2</ref> </char></note> Sheeng fintswots dootse keewarr kashon beetune, gond fintswotsemó dowootse keer boere boats angshetwe.<verse eid="JHN 5:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus jangosh gawets gawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30"/>«Taa t took alon eegor k'alo falratse, ernmó nihoke t shishtso angshitwe, taan woshtso b́ geyirwok'owa bako t geyirwok'o t angshrawotse t angsho kááwe. <verse eid="JHN 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31"/>Taa t took jangosh t gawitk wotiyal t gawts gawo arikaliye. <verse eid="JHN 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32"/>Ernmó t jangosh gawitwo k'osho fa'e, bíwere t jangosh b́gawit gawo arik b́ wotitwok'o danfee. <verse eid="JHN 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:33 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 1:19-27">Yoh. 1:19-27</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 3:27-30">3:27-30</ref> </char></note> Itiye Yohans maants wosho amtsuwotsi woshatniye it teshi, bíwere aro gawere. <verse eid="JHN 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34"/>Han tietiriye it kashitwok'owa bako taash ash gawo b́geyitsoshaliye. <verse eid="JHN 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35"/>Yohans aat'at c'eshts c'eshok'oyiye b́ teshi, it were muk' aawosh b́ sháánits sháánon gene'osh itgeyi. <verse eid="JHN 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36"/>Ernmó taa Yohans gawtsoniyere bog gawo detsfe, t gawonúwere t nih tfinitwok'o taash b́'imts finoniye, t finit finmanwere niho taan b́wooshtsok'o t jango gawitwe. <verse eid="JHN 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:37 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat. 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mar. 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luk'. 3:22</ref> </char></note> Taan woshts Niho b́ tookon t jango gawere, itmó b́ k'aaro b́jamon shiyatste, bíaronowere b́ jamon be'atste. <verse eid="JHN 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38"/>Bí b́woshtso it amanerawotse b́ aap'o itnibots geratste. <verse eid="JHN 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39"/>It S'ayin mas'aafwotsitse dúre dúri kasho it daatsitwok'o itsh bí'artsotse boon p'ec'at its'iliri, boowere t jangosh gawirwotsiye. <verse eid="JHN 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40"/>Ernmó it kashu daatsosh t maants woo geratste. <verse eid="JHN 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41"/>Taa mango ashoke geeratse. <verse eid="JHN 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42"/>It it nibotse Ik'o shunawwotsi it wottsok'o danfee. <verse eid="JHN 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43"/>Taa t nih shútson waare, itmó taan de'atste, ernmó k'osho b́took shútson b́waal b́ín dek'etute. <verse eid="JHN 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44"/>It atsatseyosh mango geyirwots Ik' ikoke daatset mangonmó gerawwots, awuk'o k'alrniya amanosh it faliti? <verse eid="JHN 5:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45"/>Taa t nih shinatse itn t s'aamitwok'o ark'aya itsha, iti s'amitwo bín it jangirwo Museyiye. <verse eid="JHN 5:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46"/>Museyi amaneerte wotink'e bí tjango b́ guut'tsotse taanor amaniyank'te b́tesh. <verse eid="JHN 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47"/>Bí b́ guut'tso amaneratste wotiyal t aap'o awuk'o k'alrniya it amaniti?»<verse eid="JHN 5:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesus úts kum ashuwotsi b́maanzitsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat. 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mar. 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk'. 9:10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1"/>Maniyereokon Iyesus Gelil aats k'aroniye bak'ets b́kimi, manwere T'ibriyados aats k'aroniye. <verse eid="JHN 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2"/>Ay ashuwots Iyesus shodtswotsi kashit b́k'alts adits keewo bobek'tsosh b́shuutso shoy dek't bosha'i. <verse eid="JHN 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3"/>Iyesus guri abaats kesht manoke b́ danifwotsnton beeb́dek'i. <verse eid="JHN 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4"/>Ayhudiwots fazigi baaliyo manoor t'intni b́tesh.<verse eid="JHN 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5"/>Manoor Iyesus ay asho b́maants b́waafe dambaan kawdek't s'iilt Filp'ossh, «Jam ashaansh bodet misho eewkneya keewosh nofaliti?» bí et. <verse eid="JHN 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6"/>Iyesus man b́ keew Filip'osi fadbek'osha bako b́k'alitwok'o bí b́tookon danfee b́tesh.<verse eid="JHN 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7"/>Flip'oswere «Botook tookosh mishi tiish tisho dab imosh git bal Dinariyon misho keewere boosh boratse» ett bíaaniy.<verse eid="JHN 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8"/>B́ danifuwotsitse iko Sim'on P'et'ros eshu Indriyas hank'o bíet, <verse eid="JHN 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9"/>«Uts geshi mishonat<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:9 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Uts geshi misha: </char><char style="ft">Etirwo Giriki mas'aafotse uts geshi tusha etfe. </char></note> git mus' detsts na'a iko hanoke fa'e bíeti, ernmó han jam ashaansh awukoneya b́ bodeti?» <verse eid="JHN 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10"/>Iyesuswere «Ashuwotsi beezwore» bíet. Manoke ay mooc'o fa'e b́tesh, ashuwotswere be bodek', botaawonúwere nungushi aano úts kumok'o bornke botesh. <verse eid="JHN 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11"/>Maniyere hakon Iyesus mishman k'a'udek't b́údiyakon beyiru ashuwotssh b́ kayi. Mank'o mus'uwotsi boosh b́ kayi, jametsuwots boosh b́ bodetuwok'owo bodaatsi. <verse eid="JHN 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12"/>Jametswots maat boworiyakon Iyesus b́ danifuwotssh, «Ik jago dats oorar bíawasherawk'o mishifed'o kakwere» bíet. <verse eid="JHN 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13"/>Bowere ash ashuwots maat bo eree ortso útś geshi mishi tishuwots fed'o kakudek't tatse git mishimaron s'eentsbok'ri.<verse eid="JHN 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14"/>Ashuwots Iyesus b́ fints aditsman bo bek'tsok'on, «Datsats weetwo nebiyiyo ariko haniye!» bo eti. <verse eid="JHN 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15"/>Ashuwotsmó angnon de'amr bín nugús woshosh gawbok'rtsok'o dank'rat aani Iyesus bí'al guri abaats k'azbiami.<verse eid="JHN 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus aatsi k'ari abaatse sha'efere bíamtsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mat. 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mar. 6:45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16"/>Datso b́ iltsok'on b́ danifuwots aats k'aro maants k'az bo'ot'. <verse eid="JHN 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17"/>Jelbats kinddek't K'frnahom maants bo tuwi, manoori sa'atonuwere t'aluwtsere b́tesh, Iyesuswere book warafa'e b́ tesh. <verse eid="JHN 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18"/>Jong kup'o b́ jongefere b́ teshtsotse, aatsi k'aro giwu b́wutsi. <verse eid="JHN 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19"/>B́ danifuwots wee útso wee shirt kilo metrok'o jelbu jook dek't boama'iyakon Iyesus aatsatse sha'efere jelbu maants b́ t'infere bek't shatboguts. <verse eid="JHN 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20"/>Bímó «Taane! shatk'ayere!» bíet. <verse eid="JHN 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21"/>Bowere gene'uwat bí jelbuts b́kindituwok'o bo geyi, manorowere jelbu boamiru datsats ambodbwtsi.<verse eid="JHN 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus kashi misho b́wottsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22"/>Yatsok'on aats k'aroniyere bak'etse oorat teshts ashuwots, aats k'aratse jelbu ik s'uz b́teshtsok'onat manoknowere b́ danifuwots s'uz boamtsok'o, Iyesusmó bonton jelbuts b́ kindrawok'o bek'tni botesh. <verse eid="JHN 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23"/>Wotowa eree k'osh jelbuwots T'bryadositse tuut Iyesusi údon Ik' b́ k'ontsokonat ash asho mish bomaatsok boweyi. <verse eid="JHN 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24"/>Ash ashuwots Iyesus wotowa b́ danifwots manoke bo aaltsok'o bo bek'tsok'on jelb manotsits kind dek't Iyesusi geyo K'frnahom maants boami. <verse eid="JHN 6:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25"/>Aats k'aronye bak'etse bín bodatstsok'on, «Danifono, hanok awure nweyi?» bo et.<verse eid="JHN 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26"/>Iyesuswere hank'o ett boosh bíaaniy, «Arikon, arikoniye itsh ti'etiriye, it taan it geyirye misho maat it wortsosha bako adits keewo it bek'tsoshaliye. <verse eid="JHN 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27"/>T'afit mishosh fink'ayere, maniyere Ik'o niho arikon daniyosh matabon b́ togts ash na'o b́ imet dúre dúri kash wotit mishosh finore.»<verse eid="JHN 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28"/>Ash ashuwotsuwere «Beree, Ik'i fino finosh eeg k'ale geyiti nosha?» boeti.<verse eid="JHN 6:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29"/>Bíwere «Ik'i finoniyere Ik'o b́ woshtson amanee» ett boosh bíaaniy.<verse eid="JHN 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30"/>Bowere bísh hank'owa boet, «Be'er neen noamanish adits keewo finitwiya? Eebi nfinitwo fa'oni? <verse eid="JHN 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:31 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 16:4">Kesh. 16:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:24">Dub. 78:24</ref> </char></note> ‹Bomeetuwok'o darotse misho boosh imre› ett guut'etsok'on, no nihots worwotse darotse oot'ts meno maarne.»<verse eid="JHN 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32"/>Manoor Iyesus hank'owa boosh bíeti, «Arikon arikoniye itsh tietiriye, darotse oot'ts misho itsh imtso Museyiyaliye, arik wotts misho darotse itsh imetwo t nihiye, <verse eid="JHN 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33"/>Ik'i misho darotse ood'r datsansh kash imetwo bíne.» <verse eid="JHN 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34"/>Mansh ashuwots «Doonzono! man naari misho úni aawo noosh ime» bo eti.<verse eid="JHN 6:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35"/>Iyesuswere hank'o boosh bíet, «Kashi misho taane, tiyok weetuwo b́ jamon k'ak'eratse, taan amanitwo b́ jamon shashweratse, <verse eid="JHN 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36"/>Itiyere taan bek'rte ernmó taan amaneratste etirwe. <verse eid="JHN 6:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37"/>Niho taash b́ imetu jamo tiyok weetwe, tiyok wetwono b́ jamon taa úromaants gisheratse. <verse eid="JHN 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38"/>Taa darotse oot'at t waa taan woshtso bí ettso k'alosha bako t shuntso k'alishaliye. <verse eid="JHN 6:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39"/>Taan woshtso b́ shuntsonye taash b́ imts jamotse dab ikunor t t'afirawo dúris'uwi aawots k'irotse t tuzitwok'owe <verse eid="JHN 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40"/>Ee! t nih b́ shuntsoniye naayo be'er bín amanitu jamo dúre dúri kasho b́ datsitwok'owe, taawere dúri s'uwi aawots k'irotse bín tuuzitwe.» <verse eid="JHN 6:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41"/>«Darotse oot'tso misho taane» Iyesus bí ettsotse ayhudiwots bíatsats bo mumundi, <verse eid="JHN 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42"/>Hank'o bo eti «Han Yosef naay Iyesusi woshna? B́ nihnat b́ indn danefonoshna? Eshe and aawuk'oneya ‹Darotse oot're› bíetiri?»<verse eid="JHN 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43"/>Iyesuswere hank'o ett boosh bíaaniy, «It ats atseyo mumundk'ayere, <verse eid="JHN 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44"/>Taan woshtso niho b́ getstsoniyere okoon t maants woo falituwo konwor aaliye, t maants wetwonowere dúri s'úwi aawots k'irotse tuuzitwe. <verse eid="JHN 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:45 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 54:13">Isa. 54:13</ref> </char></note> Nebiywots mas'aafotse ‹Ash jametswots Ik'oke danetwotsi wotitune› ett guut'ere, manshe nihoke shisht dants jametso tiyok weetwe. <verse eid="JHN 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46"/>Man etonwere niho bek'ts asho fa'e etoshaliye, niho bek'tsoniye Ik'oke waatsos'uziye. <verse eid="JHN 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47"/>Ariko arikoniye itsh ti etiriye, taan amants asho dúre dúri kasho detsfe. <verse eid="JHN 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48"/>Taaye kashi mish taane. <verse eid="JHN 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49"/>It nihots worwotse meno bo meyi, ernmó k'ire bok'iri. <verse eid="JHN 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50"/>Darotse oot'ts misho haniye, eshe mishman meetwo b́jamon k'irratse. <verse eid="JHN 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51"/>Darotse oot'tso kasho imet mishoniye taane, mish man meetu jamo dúre dúroshe b́ beeti, daatsosh kash b́wotitwok'o taa t imetwo misho t meetsoniye.»<verse eid="JHN 6:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52"/>Manoor ayhudiwots «Ashaan b́ meetso nometwok'o aawk'o k'alde'eniya noosh imo b́faliti?» ett boatsatsewo bo mooshi.<verse eid="JHN 6:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53"/>Mansh Iyesus boosh hank'o bí eti, «Arikon, arikoniye itsh t keewiri Ash na'o meetso moo itk'azal, b́ s'atso úsho it k'azal kasho deshatste. <verse eid="JHN 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54"/>Tmeets meetuwonat ts'ats úshetu jamo dúre dúri kasho detsfe, taawere dúris'uwi aawots k'irotse bín tuuzitwe. <verse eid="JHN 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55"/>T meetso ari mishe, t s'atsonwere ari úshe. <verse eid="JHN 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56"/>T meets meetwonat s'aats úshetu jamo taantoniye b́ beetiye, taawere bíntoniye tbeetiye. <verse eid="JHN 6:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57"/>Beyar beetwo niho taan b́woshtsok'onat bí atse tuutson taawor beyar beetwo twottsok'on mank'o t meets meetu jamo ti'atse tuutso beyar beetwo wotitwe. <verse eid="JHN 6:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58"/>Eshe darotse oot'tso misho haniye, bíwere it nihots bo maatsi naaraliye, mishman maatswotsiye k'irrne, misháán metwotsiye dúre dúroshe bobeti.»<verse eid="JHN 6:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59"/>Iyesus han b́ keewu K'frnahomitse ayhudi Ik' k'oni mootse b́ daniyore.<verse eid="JHN 6:59"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dúre dúri kash aap'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60"/>B́danifuwotsitse ayuwotsi man boshishtsok'on, «Aap'an mange, kone fal k'ebeti?» bo et.<verse eid="JHN 6:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61"/>B́danifwots keewan jango bo mumdtsok'o b́ gitsotse dandek't boosh hank'o bíeti, «Keewan itsh t'ugeya b́ wotiti? <verse eid="JHN 6:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62"/>Ash na'o b́beyok aanar b́kesho it bek'or eege it eteti? <verse eid="JHN 6:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63"/>Kasho imetwo Ik'i shayire, ash angonmó egoshoru woteratse, taa itsh t aap'tso shayire, manwere kashe, <verse eid="JHN 6:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64"/>Ernmó ititsere amanerawu ik ikwots fa'ane,» Iyesuswere han b́ keewoniyere shinon bín amanerawwots konotsi bowottsok'onat bín beshide imetwo koni b́wottsok'o b́dantsotsne. <verse eid="JHN 6:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65"/>Manats dabt Iyesus «Ik'o nihoke alo bísh imeyala bako tiyok wóósh falitwo aaliye tiet manshe» bíet.<verse eid="JHN 6:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66"/>Hanatse tuutson b́ danifwotsitse aywots jiik'omand k'az bo aani, manortson Iyesus shuutso sha'o k'azbok'ri. <verse eid="JHN 6:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67"/>Mansh, «Itwere aanar amo geefteya?» ett Iyesus b́ danifuwotssh bíaati. <verse eid="JHN 6:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68"/>Manoor S'im'on P'et'ros hank'o ett bíaani, «Doonzono! kon maantse noameti? Nee dúre dúri kashi aap'o detsfne. <verse eid="JHN 6:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:68-69 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 16:16">Mat. 16:16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:29">Mar. 8:29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:20">Luk'. 9:20</ref> </char></note> Nooyere amanerone, S'ayino Ik'o naayi nwottsok'o danrone.» <verse eid="JHN 6:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70"/>Iyesuswere, «Tatse gitetswotsi itn galdek'rosha? ernmó ititse iko Dabilosiye» boosh bí eti. <verse eid="JHN 6:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71"/>Manowere bíetir Simon naay Ask'rwot dats asho Yihud jangosha b tesh, Yihud b́ danif tatse gitwotsitse iko wotb́jinalor Iyesusi beshide imetwo bín b́wottsotsna.<verse eid="JHN 6:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesusnat bíeshwotsn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:1 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="LEV 23:34">Lew. 23:34</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:13">Iwi. 16:13</ref> </char>
    </note> Maniyere hakon Iyesus Gelil datsatse bíananefere b́teshi, Ayhdiwots bín úd'osh geeyat boteshtsotse Yhud datsatse anaanosh falatse b́ tesh. <verse eid="JHN 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2"/>Manoor Ayhdiyots daasiy baaliyo karnre b́ teshi. <verse eid="JHN 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3"/>Mansh b́ eshwots Iyesus maants t'int hank'o bo eti, «N danifwots n finiru fino bo bek'etwok'o hanoke tuur Yhud datso maants amee, <verse eid="JHN 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4"/>Sháánátse danewosh geyiru asho b́ fino aashde finerake, neewor keewu jametsanotsi n finoŕ n tooko datsush n kitso geyife.» <verse eid="JHN 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5"/>Han bokeewwere bíeshwotswor dab bín amanerak bowottsoshe.<verse eid="JHN 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6"/>Iyesuswere hank'o boosh bíet, «Tiaawo andoor borafa'ee, it aawonmó jamaawo itsh k'anke. <verse eid="JHN 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7"/>Datsu iti shit'osh falratsane, Taanmó b fino gond́ b wottsok'o tkeewirwosh taan b́shit'iri. <verse eid="JHN 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8"/>It baaliyok ameree, taayere tiaawo andoor b́borafa'otse bali manok amatse.» <verse eid="JHN 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9"/>Bí mank'o ett Galilon k'az b́ oori.<verse eid="JHN 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus daasi baaliyatse b́datsetsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10"/>Ernmó bí eshuwots baaliyok k'az boamiyakon b́be'erawo ááshoń baaliyok bíamí. <verse eid="JHN 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11"/>Balimanatsnowere «Bí eewke?» etfetst ayhudiwots bín bogeyiri bo tesh. <verse eid="JHN 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12"/>Ashuwots b́ jango shaashkona bo keeweyri b́ tesh, ik ikuwots «Bí ash shenge» bo etor, k'oshwotswere dabt «Woteratse bí ashuwotsi b́ dariyirye» bo etir b́ tesh. <verse eid="JHN 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13"/>Wotowa eree ayhudi naash naashwotsi bo shattsatse tuutso konwor b́ jango kish sháánon keewratse.<verse eid="JHN 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14"/>Baliyiman badatse Iyesus Ik móóts amt daniyo dek' b́twi. <verse eid="JHN 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15"/>Ayhudiwotswere, «Ash han b́ danawo jaman ak'onya danosh b́ fali?» ett bo adir b́ tesh.<verse eid="JHN 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16"/>Mansh Iyesus hank'o ett boosh bíaani «T daniyoniye taan woshtsoke daatseka bako tiyokikaliye. <verse eid="JHN 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17"/>Taan woshtso b́ geyirwo k'alosh shuntso b́ beyal daniyeyiru danań Ik'oke daatsek wee taa t tookon tkeewirwo b́ woto danetwe. <verse eid="JHN 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18"/>B́took keew keewirwo b́ took manga b́ geefoni, woshtso mango geyirwonmo bi arkeewke, kootonwere deshatse. <verse eid="JHN 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19"/>Muse nemo itsh imroshna? ititsnmó nemon sha'irwo konwor aaliye. It eegoshe taan úd'osh itgeyiri?»<verse eid="JHN 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20"/>Ash ashonwere «Niyatsne fo'erawoniye fa'oni, neen úd'osh kone geyirwoni?» boet.<verse eid="JHN 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21"/>Iyesuswere hank'o ett boosh bíaaniy, «Taa ik fino finere, it jametswere fin man jangosh it adiri. <verse eid="JHN 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 17:10">Aze. 17:10</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 12:3">Lew. 12:3</ref> </char></note> Muse gof damiy nemo itsh imre, nemanwere b́waa nih nihwotsokna bako Musewoknaliy, itmo Ik' aawon ashuwotsi gofo it damiri. <verse eid="JHN 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:23 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 5:9">Yoh. 5:9</ref> </char></note> Eshe Muse weeron imets nemo tiitserawok'o ett sanbati aawon asho gofo damiyeyiri wotiyal, taa sanbati aawots ash ats jamo t kashitsosh eegishe taan it fayiri? <verse eid="JHN 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24"/>Ariko angshwere bako ash aawo s'iilr k'uuride angshk'ayere.»<verse eid="JHN 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mesiyo jangosh tizets moosho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25"/>Iyerusalem ash ashuwotsitse ik ikwots hank'o bo et, «Úd'osh bogeyiru asho haniyoshna?» <verse eid="JHN 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26"/>Hambe! biye shiratsne b́ keewiri, boowere bísh eegor eratsne, ashaan Krstosi b́ wottsok'o arikon naash naashwots danfnok'úna? <verse eid="JHN 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27"/>B́wotiyalor ashaan ewkiko b́wottsok'o no danfone, Krstos b́woormo ewkik b́wottsok'o danetwo konwor aaliye. <verse eid="JHN 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28"/>Mansh Iyesus Ik' mootse b́ danifere k'aro eensh dek't hank'o bíet, «Taan danfte, ewuke twatsok'onowere danfte, ernmó taa t took alon waratse, taan woshtso bí arkeewetske, itmó bín danatste. <verse eid="JHN 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29"/>Taayere biyoke twaatsonat bí taan b́woshtsotse taa bin danfee.» <verse eid="JHN 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30"/>Manoor bín detsosh geyatni botesh, ernmó bíaawo b́borafa'otse konwor bín deshatse. <verse eid="JHN 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31"/>B́wotiyalor ash ashotse ayuwots bín boaani, hank'owere etrno «Krstos b́woormo ashaan b́k'alts aditswotsiyere bogeya b́ finiti?»<verse eid="JHN 7:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesusi bodetsish kes' kes'fwotsi woshetsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32"/>Ash ashuwots Iyesus jango shashkon bokeewefere ferisawino eteefwots bo shishi, mansh kahniy naashwotsnat ferisawino eteefuwotsn Iyesusi detsiyosh Ik' maa kotfuwotssh bokeewi. <verse eid="JHN 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33"/>Manoor Iyesus hank'o bíet, «Itnton muk'i teshetwe, maniyere okoon taan woshtsok ametuwe, <verse eid="JHN 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34"/>It taan geyitute, ernmó taan daatsratste, taa t beyok woo it falratste.»<verse eid="JHN 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35"/>Mansh ayhudiwots bo atsatsewosh hank'o bo et, «Bín nodaatsrawok'o ashaan ewkek'una bíameti? Daneraka Grik dats ashuwots dagots bad'ts ayhudiwotsok amr Ik' danawu ashuwotsi danishe k'úna? <verse eid="JHN 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36"/>‹Taan geyitute, ernmó daatsratste taa tbeyirwok wosh falatste› bíetor eeg etoshe?»<verse eid="JHN 7:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kashi t'úp' wotts aats t'úp'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:37 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="LEV 23:36">Lew. 23:36</ref> </char>
    </note> Baaliyi s'uwi aawu wotts een aawots Iyesus need'dek't b́ k'aaro eenshdek't hank'o bíet, «Aats shashutso fa'e wotiyal t maants waar úyee. <verse eid="JHN 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:38 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EZK 47:1">Hzk'. 47:1</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 14:8">Zek. 14:8</ref> </char></note> Taan amantso S'ayin mas'aafotse bíetiruwo kash ats t'uup'o b́ gitsotse t'uup'tuwe.» <verse eid="JHN 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39"/>Han bíetirwe bíń amanitwots bodek'et S'ayin shayiri jangosha b́tesh, Iyesus mango maants b́ keyafa'otse S'ayin shayiro imerafa'e b́tesh.<verse eid="JHN 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ashuwots dagotse k'osh k'oshewo b́wottsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40"/>Mann ash ashi dagotse Ik ikwots keewman boshishtsok'on, «Weetwe eteets nebiyiwo arikon haniye» boet. <verse eid="JHN 7:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41"/>K'oshwotswere «Han Krstosiye» bo eti. K'atswotsmó «Krstos b́weet Gelilneya? <verse eid="JHN 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:42 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 7:12">1 Sam. 7:12</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 5:2">Mik. 5:2</ref> </char></note> Krstos b́shuwet Dawit narotsnat Dawit kitotse Betelihemitse b́ weetwok'o S'ayin mas'fotse guut'roshna?» bo et. <verse eid="JHN 7:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43"/>Mann ash ashi dagotse b́ jangatse tuutson k'osh k'oshewo wotb́wutsi. <verse eid="JHN 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44"/>Boyitse ik ikwots bín detsosh geerno botesh, s'uznmó konwor bíndeshatse.<verse eid="JHN 7:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ayhudi naashwots amano bok'aztsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45"/>Maniye hakon kot kotfuwots kahni naashuwotsnat ferisawiwots maants aanat boami, boowere «Eegishe bín dek'woo it k'azi?» bo boeti.<verse eid="JHN 7:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46"/>Kes' kes'fwotswere, «Ashaan b́ keewiru keewi naaro konúwor keew danake» ett boaaniyi.<verse eid="JHN 7:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47"/>Ferisawino eteefwotsmó hank'o boeti, «Itwere daarisheya? <verse eid="JHN 7:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48"/>Wotowabako naash naashotse wee ferisawino eteefwotsitse bín amantso fa'a? <verse eid="JHN 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49"/>Muse nemo danawu ash ashaan arikon c'asheke.»<verse eid="JHN 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:50 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="JHN 3:1-2">Yoh. 3:1-2</ref> </char>
    </note> Haniyre shin Iyesusok amt teshtsonat fersawiwotsitse iko wottso Nik'odimos, <verse eid="JHN 7:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51"/>«No nemok'on ash iko shin b́ keewo keewu b́de'e k'ewdek'fetsere aaninwere eeg b́k'altsok'owo danfitsere bí ats angshefá?» bíet.<verse eid="JHN 7:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52"/>Bowere, «Nee were Gelil maantsknenya? nebiyiwo Gelilitse b́ tuurawok'o p'ec'ar shuu'de dane» bo et. <verse eid="JHN 7:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53"/>Maniye il jametso b́ gal gal k'az bíami.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:53 </char><char style="ft">7:53—8:11 Yoots kishioon guut'ets ik ik mas'aafi biitswotsitse daatseratsne. </char></note><verse eid="JHN 7:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8"/>
  <para style="s">Widatse daatsets máátsu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1"/>Maniyeokoon Iyesus Debrezyit guro maants bíami. <verse eid="JHN 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2"/>Yaatśguurok'on Ik' moo maants aanat b́waa, ash jamonwere b́ maants bo weyi, bíwere bedek't boon b́ danifere b́ teshi. <verse eid="JHN 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3"/>Nemo danifuwotsnat ferisawino eteefuwots widoke detsets máátsu dek' waat ash ashi dagots ned'ibok'iri. <verse eid="JHN 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4"/>Iyesusshowere hank'o boeti, «Danifino, hamb máátsani widoke detserane, <verse eid="JHN 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 20:10">Lew. 20:10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 22:22-24">Iwi. 22:22-24</ref> </char></note> Hank'o máátsu shutson togeyar b k'iritwok'owa Muse no nemotse b́ beezi, nemo b jangosh aawk'owe nieteti?» <verse eid="JHN 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6"/>Man bo etirwe bíatse bín s'amiyosh betsit keewo bodaatsitwok'o geyatni botesh, Iyesusmo dashan túmt b́ jabon datsats guut'o dek' b́ tuwi.<verse eid="JHN 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7"/>Anani bo aatre dambaan jobk' et kawdek't, «Ititse morr deshawo shini shútso k'aaú de biats shawu'e!» boosh bíet. <verse eid="JHN 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8"/>Maniyere hak aaniy tuumt datsats b́ guut'i. <verse eid="JHN 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9"/>Bowere man boshishtsok'on enaashatse dek't b́ tuutso jametswots ik ikon manoke k'az boami, mansh Iyesus taalotse need'at teshts máátsu s'uznton bíaal oorbgutsi.<verse eid="JHN 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10"/>Maniyere okoon Iyesus dambaan kawdek't, «Máátsune neena! neen s'aamirwots aabno? Niats angshitso konwor aalneya?» bíet.<verse eid="JHN 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11"/>Biwere «Doonzono! konwor aaliye» bi eti. Iyesuswere «Taawor niats angshratse, amee gitlo morro fink'aye» bíet. <verse eid="JHN 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 5:14">Mat. 5:14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 9:5">Yoh. 9:5</ref> </char></note> Aaninwere Iyesus «Taa datsush sháán taane, tshuuts sha'itwo bí kashosh wotit shááano daatsitwe, t'alwotsnowere anaaneratse» ett boosh b́keewi.<verse eid="JHN 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:13 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="JHN 5:13">Yoh. 5:13</ref> </char>
    </note> Ferisawno etfwots «Nee n took jangoshe n gawiriye, n gawonwere arikaliye» boet.<verse eid="JHN 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14"/>Iyesuswere hank'o ett boosh bíaaniy, «Dab taa t took jangosha tkeewiri b́wotiyalor taa ewuke t waatsok'o, aawok timiruwok'o t dantsotse t gawts gawo arikee, itmó aawoke t waatsok'onat aawok tiamirwok'o danatste. <verse eid="JHN 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15"/>It ash etok'one it angshiri, taamó konatsor angshratse. <verse eid="JHN 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16"/>Dab tiangshiyalor taan woshtso niho taanton b́ wottsotsnat taa tial tiangshrawotse tiangsho arikee, <verse eid="JHN 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17"/>Git ashuwots gawuts gawo arik b́ wottsok'o it nemotse guut'ere. <verse eid="JHN 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18"/>Mansh taa tjangosh gawituwe, taan woshts Nihonuwere t jangosh gawituwe.» <verse eid="JHN 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19"/>Manoor bo «N nih ewuke b́fa'oni?» ett bo aati. Iyesuswere «Taan wotowa t nihi wotowa danatste, taan it danink'e t nihino danank'te b́teshi» ett boosh bíaani.<verse eid="JHN 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20"/>Iyesus keewan b́ keewu Ik' mootse giz dek'eyiru sat'ni ganoke bedek't b́ daniyora. B́wotiyalor b́ gizewo b́ borafa'otse konuwor bín deshatse.<verse eid="JHN 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aman k'azi jangosh keewets sheefo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21"/>Anyinuwere Iyesus hank'o boosh bíet, «Taawere ametuwe, itwere taan geyitute, ernmó it morrontona it k'iriti bako taa tiamiruwok it wosh falratste.»<verse eid="JHN 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22"/>Ayhudi naashuwotswere « ‹Taa tiametwok it woo falratste› bíetir b́ tooko úd'ishek'una?» boats atsewo boeti.<verse eid="JHN 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23"/>Manats dabt Iyesus hank'o boosh bíet, «It daashik itne, taa dambik taane, it datsanatsik itne taamó datsanatsik taanaliye, <verse eid="JHN 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24"/>Taa Bín twottsok'o amano it k'azal it morronton it k'iritwotse it morrontoniye it k'iriti tietiye manshe.»<verse eid="JHN 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25"/>Bowere «Nee konene?» boet.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:25">Iyesuswere boosh hank'o bíet, «Shintson tuzdek'at itsh t keewtsok'on taane, <verse eid="JHN 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26"/>It jangosh t keewitwonat tiangshitwo ay keewo detsfe, s'uznmó taan woshtso ari keewetske, taawor datsush t keewitwo bíyoke t shishtsoniye.»<verse eid="JHN 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27"/>Bí niho jango b́ keewtsok'o boosh galeratse b́ tesh. <verse eid="JHN 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28"/>Mannsh Iyesus boosh hank'o bíeti, «Ash na'o dambaan tuuzde'er it jitor taa bín t wottsok'o danetute, mank'o niho taash b́danitso t keewirwok'oni bako tialmec'ron eegor t k'alrawok'o manoor t'iwintsitute. <verse eid="JHN 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29"/>Taan woshtso taantoniye, aaw aawon t k'aliruwo bín geneushit keew b́wottsotse ti'ali k'azk'reratsee.»<verse eid="JHN 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30"/>Iyesus man b́keeutsok'on ay ashuwots bín boamani.<verse eid="JHN 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Morri guuts wototse keshi jango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31"/>Iyesus bín amants ayhudiwotssh hankowa bíet, «It t aap'o korede bín it beyal arikon t danifuwotsi wotitute, <verse eid="JHN 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32"/>Aronowere danetute, aronuwere iti s'ayino kishitwe.»<verse eid="JHN 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:33 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="JHN 3:9">3:9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:8">Luk'. 3:8</ref> </char>
    </note> Boomó «Noo Abraham naar noone, b́ jamon konshor guuts wot danaknone, eshe nee ‹Nas'o keshetute› noosh nietir aawuk'oneya?» bo et.<verse eid="JHN 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34"/>Iyesuswere hank'o ett boosh bíaaniy, «Arikon arikoniye itsh tietiri, morr finiru jamo morri guutse, <verse eid="JHN 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35"/>Guutso jam aawosh mootse beerake, na'onmó jam aawosh mootse b́befoni. <verse eid="JHN 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36"/>Mansh naayo nas'o iti b́ kishyal arikon nas'o wotitute. <verse eid="JHN 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37"/>Abraham naar it wottsok'o taa danfee, ernmó t keewo it de'awotse taan úd'osh it geyiri. <verse eid="JHN 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38"/>Taa t nihoke t bek'tsoniye tkeewiri, itmó it nihoke it shishtsoniye it k'aliri.»<verse eid="JHN 8:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39"/>Bowere «Nonih Abrahamiye» ett boaaniy. Iyesuswere boosh hank'o bíeti, «Abraham nana'uwotsi it wotink'ere Abraham finoniye it finyank'oni, <verse eid="JHN 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40"/>Taaamó Ik'oke t shishts arikoniye itsh tkeewi, itmó taan úd'oshe it geyiri, Abraham mank'o k'alratse. <verse eid="JHN 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41"/>Eshe it itfiniriye it nih finoniye.» Bowere «Widon shuwets dik'al noanaliye, ik nihe nodetsi bíwere Ik'oniye» bo et.<verse eid="JHN 8:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42"/>Iyesuswere hank'o boosh bíeti, «Ik'o it nihi b́wotink'ermó taan shunank'te b́ teshi, taa hanok t weyiye Ik'okne, taan woshtso bína bako taa ttookon waratse. <verse eid="JHN 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43"/>Eegoshe t keewo itsh gaalo bk'azi? T aap' shisho it maawutsoshe. <verse eid="JHN 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44"/>It itnih Diyablos nana'uwots itne, it it shuniye it nih teuniruwo k'aloshe, bi shintson dek't b́tuutso kash úd'ke, arikeewo bíyoke bíaaltsotse arikeewonton b́ jamon gonkeyo deshatse, bí kootetskonat koot jami nih b́wottsotse koto b́keewor b́ tookotse kishdek'tni b́keewiri. <verse eid="JHN 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45"/>Taayere ariko tkeewirwosh taan amaneratste, <verse eid="JHN 8:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46"/>Aab ititse ‹Morretsk neene› etetuwo kone? Arika t keewiri wotiyal bere, eegoshe taan amano it k'azi? <verse eid="JHN 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47"/>Ik'okik wottso Ik'i aap'e b́ shishfoni, eshe it Ik'i aap'o shisho it k'azir Ik'okik woto it k'aztsoshe.»<verse eid="JHN 8:47"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesusnat Abrahamn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48"/>Ayhudiwots, «Neehe Samrawinene, Fo'erawoniye niatse fa'ee no ettso ar woteratsáá?» boeti.<verse eid="JHN 8:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49"/>Iyesuswere hank'o et boosh bianiy, «Taa fo'erawo tiatse aaliye, ernmó t nihiye tmangiyiri, itmó taana it ketiyri. <verse eid="JHN 8:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50"/>Wotowa bako taa t took mango geeratse, t mangi jangosh moshetwonat taash angishitwo k'osho fa'ee. <verse eid="JHN 8:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51"/>Arikon arikone itsh tietiriye, ti aap'o kor dek'etwoniye b́ jamon k'irratse.»<verse eid="JHN 8:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52"/>Ayhudiwots hank'owa bísh boet, «Fo'erawo niatse b́beyiruwok'o and danrone, dab́ Abrahmwor k'irre, nebiyiwotswere k'irrne, nemon ‹T aap'o kordek'etwo b́jamon k'irratse› etfne, <verse eid="JHN 8:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53"/>Eshe nee no nih k'irtso Abrahamiyere bogfiya? nebiyiwots k'irrno, eshe nee n tooko koni woshishe?» <verse eid="JHN 8:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54"/>Iyesus hank'o ett bíaaniy, «Taa t tooko t mangiyal t mango k'auntso deshatse taan mangiyituwo t nihiye, bíwere ‹No Ik'oniye› it etirwoni. <verse eid="JHN 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55"/>B́ wotiyalor it bín danatste, taamo bín danfee, taa bín danatse tietalmó itkok'o kootetsoniye twoti, taamo bín danfee, b́ aap'onowere kordek'etuwe. <verse eid="JHN 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56"/>It nih Abraham ti aawo b́ bek'etwosh gene'owere, bek'tnwere gene'uwere.»<verse eid="JHN 8:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57"/>Manoor ayhudiwots, «Nee dab balk'ats nato woterafa'ane, eshe aawk'oneya Abrahami bek're nietiri?» bo eti. <verse eid="JHN 8:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58"/>Iyesuswere, «Arikon ariko itsh tietiriye, Abrahamiyere shin fa'e.» bíet.<verse eid="JHN 8:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59"/>Mansh ayhudiwots bin togosh shútso k'aa'u bodek'i, Iyesusmó bo aawatse ashwutsat Ik' mootse kesht biam.<verse eid="JHN 8:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesus ááw dog wotat shuwets asho b́kashitsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1"/>Iyesus werindon b́beshefere ááw dog wotat shuwetso b́ bek'i. <verse eid="JHN 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2"/>B́danifwots Iyesussh, «Danifono! ashaan dog wotat b́shuwe kon morroneya? B́ took morroneyamo bín shuutswots morroneya?»<verse eid="JHN 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3"/>Iyesuswere hank'o ett bíaaniy, «Ashaan ááwu dogo wotat b́ shuuwe b́ morron wee bínshutswots morratse tuutsonaliye, ernmó Ik'o fino bíatse b́ be'eyishee. <verse eid="JHN 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4"/>Taan woshtso fino aawon fino taash geyife, asho konwor fin b́ falraw t'úwo weetwe. <verse eid="JHN 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 5:14">Mat. 5:14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 8:12">Yoh. 8:12</ref> </char></note> Datsuatse t beyor taa datsush bsháán taane.»<verse eid="JHN 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6"/>Man b́ keewiyakon datsats tuf ett s'údt b́ s'údon shaawo b́ baad'i, tok'mannowere dogo aawats futt, <verse eid="JHN 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7"/>«Amr Selihom aats kakots mashowe» bí et. (Selihom «wosheka» eta.) Mann ashman amt mashdek't s'iilfere aanat b́weyi.<verse eid="JHN 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8"/>B́ giyuwotsnat bali b́ k'onfere bín bek't teshts ashuwots, «Ashaan andi bede'e k'onfoniyosha?» boeti. <verse eid="JHN 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9"/>Ik ikwots, «Ee, ún bííne!» bo et, «K'oshwotswere bína bíari bako bínaliye!» boet. Bímó «Taane únni!» bí et. <verse eid="JHN 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10"/>Ash ashuwotswere «Beree, aak'altniya ni'aawwots bok'esheyi?» boeti. <verse eid="JHN 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11"/>Bíwere «Iyesusi eteef asho took'o bad'idek't tiááwats futt ‹Selihom maants amr mashowe› bíet, taawere amaat mashdek'at bek'o tfali» ett bíaaniy. <verse eid="JHN 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12"/>Bowere, «Ash man and aawoke b́ fa'oni?» boet. Bíwere, «Aawoke b́ beyirwok'o danatse» bí et.<verse eid="JHN 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13"/>Maniyehak ash ashuwots doogteshts asho ferisawino etef wotsok dek't boami. <verse eid="JHN 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14"/>Iyesus took'o bad'idek't ashman ááwwots bok'eshetwok'o b́ k'altso sanbati aawotsa b́tesh. <verse eid="JHN 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15"/>Ferisawino etfwots, «Aawuk'oneya bek'o nfali!» ett ashman aani boaati. Bíwere «Tiááwwotsats t'ok'o b́ geere mashtdek', maniyere hako bek'o tfali» bí et.<verse eid="JHN 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16"/>Manoor ferisawino etefuwotsitse ik ikuwots, «Ashaan sanbato b́ mangirawotse Ik'okikaliye» bo et. K'atswotswere Beree, «Morretsk wotts asho adits keewanotsi awuk'o k'alrniya fino b́faliti?» bo et. Manatse tuutson bodagotse bo keewo k'osha k'oshewo b́woti.<verse eid="JHN 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17"/>Mann ááw dog wotat teshts ashmansh, «Ni ááwo taash shanire nietiru ashman jango eege nieteti?» ett aaniy gitlo boaati. Bíwere «Nebiyiye!» bíet. <verse eid="JHN 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18"/>Ashaan dog wotat b́ teshtsok'onat ilomo bí ááwo aawk'on b́ k'eshetsok'o b́indnat nihon s'eegdek't boatfetso ayhudi naashuwots amaneratsno b́ tesh. <verse eid="JHN 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19"/>Mann b́ nihonat indunsh, «Dog wotat shuwere it etts it na'o hanneya? Eshe and awuk'o k'altniya bek'o b́fali?» ett bonboaati.<verse eid="JHN 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20"/>B́ nihnat indún hank'o ett boaaniy, «Ashaan no naayi b́wotonat dog wotat b́shuwewo danfone, <verse eid="JHN 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21"/>Ernmó and awuk'on b́ bek'iruwok'onat bíááwwotsi kon bísh b́k'eshtsok'o danatsone, bín aatwere, bí ash een b́wottsotse bí b́ jangosh keewo falitwe.» <verse eid="JHN 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22"/>B́ nihnat indn han boetuwere Iyesussh «Krstosiye» eteet asho b́beyal ayhudi naashuwots Ik' mootse kishosh ik wotdek't boteshtsotse boon boshattsosha b́ tesh. <verse eid="JHN 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23"/>Mansh bínshutswots, «Bihe ash eene, bín aatwere» boet.<verse eid="JHN 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24"/>Maantse tuutson ááw dog teshts ashman aaniy s'eegdek't, «Nee ariko keewr Ik'o mangiwe, ashaan morretsk b́woto no danfone» boet.<verse eid="JHN 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25"/>Aawu dog teshts ashmanwere, «Bi morretsk b́woto taa danatse, s'uz ik keewo danfee, manwere taa dogo tteshtsok'onat and bek'o tfaltsok'one» ett bíaaniy. <verse eid="JHN 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26"/>Bowere, «Neesh ege b́ k'ali? Ni ááwonowere awuk'o k'altniya b́ kashiyi?» bo eti. <verse eid="JHN 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27"/>Biwere, «Shinowere keewere itmó k'ebo geratste, eshe eegoshe aani ando k'ebo it geyiri? It b́ danifwotsi woto geefteya?» bíet. <verse eid="JHN 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28"/>Bowere hank'o ett bín boc'ashi, «Iyesus danifo neena, nohe Muse danifwots noone, <verse eid="JHN 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29"/>Musenton Ik'o b́keewetsok'o danfone, ashaahanmo ewukik b́wottsok'o danatsone.»<verse eid="JHN 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30"/>Ashmanmo hank'o et boosh bíaaniy, «Ashaan awokik b́ woto it daro adike! ernmó tiaawwotsi shanitso bíne. <verse eid="JHN 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31"/>Morretswots keewo Ik'o b́ k'ewawok'o daneke, ernmó Ik'o mangifonat bshunts fino k'aliru asho b beyalr bín Ik'o shishfe. <verse eid="JHN 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32"/>Aawu dog wotat shuwets asho ááwo k'eshetso fa'ee etefere datsan bíazeron shish danerake. <verse eid="JHN 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33"/>Ashaan Ik'okik woto b́k'zink'e eegor k'alosh falrawunk'e b́teshi.»<verse eid="JHN 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34"/>Bowere, «N keew jamo morron s'enat shuwetsono! Nee noon daniysheya?» ett ayhudiwots Ik' k'oni mootse kishbok'ri.<verse eid="JHN 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Shayiron dog wotts nibo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35"/>Ashman ayhudiwots Ik' k'oni mootse kish bok'rtsok'o Iyesus shish b́k'r, bin b́datstsok'onowere, «Ash na'on amanituwiya?» bíet. <verse eid="JHN 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36"/>Bíwere, «Doonzono! bín ti amanish kone bi?» bíet. <verse eid="JHN 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37"/>Iyesus, «Bín bek'rne, and neenton keeweyirwonwere bíne» bíet. <verse eid="JHN 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38"/>Bíwere, «Doonzono! amanitwe» ett bísh b́sagadi. <verse eid="JHN 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39"/>Iyesuswere, «Be'aawwots bobek'etwok'o, bek'irwotswere bodogetwok'o taa datsanats angshosh waaree» bíet. <verse eid="JHN 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40"/>Manoor Iyesus ganoke fa'a ferisawino eteefwots «Eshe noowere ááw dognona eteya?» boeti. <verse eid="JHN 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41"/>Iyesuswere, «Aaw dog it wotink'e morro it ats woterawnk'e, andmo bek'irwone it etirwotse morretswotsi wotarr ooritute» bí eti.<verse eid="JHN 9:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesus jints sheeng b́wottsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1"/>Manatse tuut Iyesus hank'o bíeti, «Ariko arikone etirwe itsha, mererwots kúrots fengeshon kindraawo k'osh weeron kinditwo ump'etsonat wombedewotsne. <verse eid="JHN 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2"/>Fengeshon kinditwonmó mererwotsi jintsoniye. <verse eid="JHN 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3"/>Bíshe fengesh kotirwo k'eshitwe, mererwotswere b́ k'aaro shishetune, bi were b́ took mererwotsi boshutson s'eegetwe, jishde'ernwere ametuwee. <verse eid="JHN 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4"/>B́took mereer jamwotsi b́ kishihakon bo shin shinatse sha'itwe, b́ mererwotswere b́ k'aaro bo dantsotse b́ shuutso shoydeniye bo sha'iti. <verse eid="JHN 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5"/>K'osho k'aaronmó bodanawotse bíyatse oka bowos'eti bako b́jámon b́ shuutso amatsne.»<verse eid="JHN 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6"/>Iyesuswere jewraan boosh b́keewi, bomo boosh b́keewetso t'iwintsratsno.<verse eid="JHN 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7"/>Mansh Iyesus ando aani hank'o boosh bíet, «Arikon arikoniye itsh ti etiriye taa mererwots fengesh taane, <verse eid="JHN 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8"/>Taayere shin waats jametswots úmp'etswotsnat bik'knee, mererwotsu bon shiyatsne. <verse eid="JHN 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9"/>Fengesho taane, tweeron kinditwo kashitwe, kinditwe, keshetwe, jinokono daatsitwe. <verse eid="JHN 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10"/>Úmp'etsonmo b́ weyiŕ úmp'isha, shukonat t'afiyon s'uzsha, taamo t waa boowere kasho daatsr s'eent s'eenk kasho bodetsetwok'owe.<verse eid="JHN 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11"/>«Jints sheengo taane, jints sheengo b́ kasho b́ mererwotssha err beshide imetwe. <verse eid="JHN 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12"/>Btokk woteraw mereer jintso b́ jinish keeweka bako ari jints woterawonu lawuwo b́ waare b́bek'or mereruwotsi k'ak'rarni b́wos'eti, lawuwonwere mererwotsi bi'ide bad'ib́k'riti. <verse eid="JHN 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13"/>Jintsman k'az b́wos'irwe keewek b́wottsonat mererwotssh kis'odeshawo b́wottsone. <verse eid="JHN 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 11:27">Mat. 11:27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:33">Luk'. 22:33</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 24:16">Lew. 24:16</ref> </char></note> Jints sheengo taane, taa t mererwotsi danfee, t mererwotswere taan danfnee. <verse eid="JHN 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15"/>Taa boon t daniru niho taan b́dantsok'o dani naaronat taawere niho t dantsi naaronee, taa t mererwotssh t kasho beshide imetwe. <verse eid="JHN 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16"/>Mereer s'eenanitse woterawo k'oshuwotsitse wotts mererwotsi detsfe, bonowere jisho taash geyife, boowere t k'ááro shishetune, ikoki mereer s'eene bowotiti, jinirwonwere ike b́ wotiti.<verse eid="JHN 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17"/>«Aani tdek'et kashú ti ímetwotse t nih taan shunfee. <verse eid="JHN 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18"/>Taa t kashu tshunon imetuwe bako tiatse konwor bin dek'etwo aaliye, t kashu imr aninuwe dek'osh alo detsfe, tzaziman tdek'were t nihoknee.»<verse eid="JHN 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19"/>B́ keewtsmanatse tuutson ayhudiwots dagotse k'osh k'oshewo wotbwtsi. <verse eid="JHN 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20"/>Boyitsnowere ayuwots, «Bí bíatse fo'erawoniye fa'oni, geewtsere, eegishe bín itk'ebiri?» boeti.<verse eid="JHN 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21"/>K'oshuwotsuwere, «B́keew keewan fo'erawo detsts ash nonotse keshetkaliye, fo'erawo bo ááwu dogwots aawo k'eshosh falituwa?» bo eti.<verse eid="JHN 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ayhudiyots aman k'azi jango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22"/>Iyerusalemitse Ik' maa nato bíhandrtsi worwoti bali aawo b́bodi, manoronwe joosha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:22 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Joosha: </char><char style="ft">Israe'el datsatse Tahsas shasho ak'onat awushetska. </char></note> b́tesh. <verse eid="JHN 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23"/>Iyesus Ik' mootse Solomon bí anaanef werindatsna bí ananefer b́tesh. <verse eid="JHN 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24"/>Manoor ayhudiwots b́ ganok ko'edek't, «Awurish b́ borfetsone git nibon noon nja'iti? Nee Krsttosi n wotok'o danide noosh keewwe» boeti.<verse eid="JHN 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25"/>Iyesusu hank'o ett boosh bíaaniy, «Taa itsh keewre, itmó amaneratste, t nih shútson tfiniru fino t jangosh gawitwe. <verse eid="JHN 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26"/>Itmó t mererwotsitse woto itk'aztsosh amaneratste. <verse eid="JHN 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27"/>T mererwots t k'aaro shishetune, taawere boon danfee, boowere t shuutso sha'itúne. <verse eid="JHN 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28"/>Taa dúre dúri kashone boosh imetwe, manshe b́jamon t'afratsne, t kishotse konwor boon kishdeatse. <verse eid="JHN 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29"/>Boon taash imtso t nih jamoniyere bogfe. Tnih kishotse boon bi'dek'o falitwo konwor aaliye. <verse eid="JHN 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30"/>Taana ett Aabn ik noone.»<verse eid="JHN 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31"/>Ayhudiwotś manoor ando aani bín togosh shútso k'a'ubodek'i. <verse eid="JHN 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32"/>Iyesuswere, «T nihoke sheeng fin ayuwotsi itsh kitsre, eshe it taan it togir t fints hanotsitse aawsha etatniya?» bí eti.<verse eid="JHN 10:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33"/>Bowere, «Noo neen notogir Ik'o nc'ashirwosha bako n fints sheeng finoshaliye, manwere nee ash wotefetsat́ n tooko Ik' n woshtsoshee» ett bísh boaaniyi.<verse eid="JHN 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:34 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PSA 82:6">Dub. 82:6</ref> </char>
    </note> Iyesuswere hank'o boosh bíet, «It nemotse ‹Itiye ik'wots it nee, eteere› ett guut'etso aalneya? <verse eid="JHN 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35"/>Eshe S'ayin mas'aafo sharosh faleratse, boosh waats Ik'i aap'o S'ayin mas'afo Izar Izewerotsi ett s'eegere. <verse eid="JHN 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36"/>Eshe, Niho S'ayntst datso maantsan b́ doyitso ‹Ik' na'o taane› bí ettsosh eegoshe ‹Ik'o c'ashre› it etiri? <verse eid="JHN 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37"/>Taa t nih fino fineratse wotiyal taan amank'ayere. <verse eid="JHN 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38"/>T nih finirwoni t finiri wotiyalmo taan dab́ amano it k'azalor t finiru finon amanore, hank'on niho taanton b́ wottsok'onat taawe nihonton twottsok'o shengshde danetute.»<verse eid="JHN 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39"/>Bowere ando aani bín detsosh bogeyi, bímó bo kishotse kesht k'az bí'ami.<verse eid="JHN 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:40 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="JHN 1:28">Yoh. 1:28</ref> </char>
    </note> Iyesus ando aani Yordanos fokoniye kimt Yohanis bali b́ gupfok bíami, manoknowere b́ teshi. <verse eid="JHN 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41"/>Ay ashuwots bíyok wáát́, «Yohanis adits fino egoŕ fineratse, ernmó Yohanis ashaan jango b́ keewts jamo aree b́ teshi» bo et. <verse eid="JHN 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42"/>Manoknowere ay ashuwots bín bo amani.<verse eid="JHN 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11"/>
  <para style="s">Alazar b́k'irtsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1"/>Betanitse beyirwo Alazari eteets ash iko shoodtni b́ tesh, Bitaniya eteyru man Mariyamnat bmish Martan bo beyru galuni b tesh. <verse eid="JHN 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2"/>Mariyami etetsmanwere doonzo tufats shitwo futat b took s'iron firtsuni, shodirúwonu bi eshu Alazari b́ tesh. <verse eid="JHN 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3"/>Mish gitwotswre, «Doonzono! n shunfo shoodwtsere» ett Iyesusok woshbok'ri.<verse eid="JHN 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4"/>Iyesusu man b́ shishtsok'on, «Shodan k'irosh betsitkaliye, s'uznmó Ik'osh mango b́ wotitwok'onat Ik' na'o bín b́ mangishe» bíet.<verse eid="JHN 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5"/>Iyesus Martanat bmish Mariyamna bo eshu Alazarnowere, shuna b́ shunfo. <verse eid="JHN 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6"/>Mansh Alazar shodo b́ shishiyakon b́beyrmanok git aawo k'az b́ jin. <verse eid="JHN 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7"/>Maniyakon b́ danifwotssh, «Woore Yhud datsats ando aanar amone» boeti.<verse eid="JHN 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8"/>B́ danifwotsu, «Danifono! ayhudiwots karn aawotse shútson neen jot'oshe bogeyri bo teshi, eshe nee ando manmaantsan amooshe ngeyiri?» boet.<verse eid="JHN 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9"/>Iyesus hanek'o ett boosh bí aani, «Ik aawotse tatse git sa'atosha? Aawon shairwo datsan shááno b́ bek'irwosh t'ugo bín dikratse. <verse eid="JHN 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10"/>Ernmó t'úwon sha'irwo shááno b́gitsotse b́deshawosh t'ugo bíne b́dikiti.» <verse eid="JHN 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11"/>Iyesus man boosh b́keewiyakon, «No mash Alazar tokrwtsere, taamo bín tokrotse tuzosh ametuwe» bíet. <verse eid="JHN 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12"/>B́danifwotstswere, «Doonzono! tokratni b́fa'oni wotiyal bére shamp'itwe etee» boeti. <verse eid="JHN 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13"/>Iyesus man b́keewirwe Alazar K'iri jangosha b́ tesh, ernmó b́ tokeri jango b́keewirwok'owa boosh bíari, <verse eid="JHN 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14"/>Mansh Iyesus kitsdek't́ sháánon hank'o ett boosh b́ keewi, «Alazar k'irre, <verse eid="JHN 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15"/>It it amanitwok'o taa manoke ti aalo itsh taan geneúshre, andmó b́ maants amone.»<verse eid="JHN 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16"/>Manoor Didimosi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Didimosi: </char><char style="ft">Eto maata eta. </char></note> eteetso Tomas b́ danif k'oshwotswere, «Bínton no k'iritwok'o nowoor amone» boet.<verse eid="JHN 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus k'ir tuwonat kash b́wottsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17"/>Iyesus manok b́ bodtsok'on Alazari duketsi awd aawo b́ jiniyakon amt b́daatsi. <verse eid="JHN 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18"/>Betaniya Iyerusalematse keez kilo metrok'oyi bwoki. <verse eid="JHN 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19"/>Ayhudiyotsitse aywots Martanat Mariyamn boeshu b́ k'irtsosh boon kup'iyosh bowok waatni bo tesh.<verse eid="JHN 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20"/>Marta Iyesus woo b shishtsok'on bín dek'osh bweyi, Mariyammó mootsa btesh. <verse eid="JHN 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21"/>Marta Iyesussh, «Doonzono! nee hanoka nfa'oni wotink'e ti eshu k'irrawnk'e b́teshi, <verse eid="JHN 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22"/>Ernmó andoru nk'onitu jamo Ik'o neesh b́imetwok'o danefe» bí et.<verse eid="JHN 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23"/>Iyesuswere «Ni eshu k'irotse aaniy tuwitwe» bíet. <verse eid="JHN 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24"/>Martawere, «Dúr s'úwatse k'irtswots k'iro da'ar bo tuwor bíwere k'irotse b́ tuwitwok'o danfee» bí et. <verse eid="JHN 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25"/>Iyesuswere, «K'ir tuwonat kashon taane, taan amantso b́k'iriyaloru kashone b́beeti, <verse eid="JHN 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26"/>Kashon befetst taan amants jamo k'irratse, han amanitwiya?» bíet.<verse eid="JHN 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27"/>Bíwere, «Ee doonzono! nee datsats waatso Krstosi Ik' na'o nwottsok'o amanitwe» bíet. <verse eid="JHN 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28"/>Marta han bkeewiyakon b mishsh amaat «Danifo waat neene b́ s'eegiri» etaat shashkon b s'eegi. <verse eid="JHN 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29"/>Mariyam man b shishtsok'on kááron tuwat bíyok bíami. <verse eid="JHN 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30"/>Manoor Iyesus Marta bín bbek'ori b́beyirwoka bako galots kindrafa'e b́tesh. <verse eid="JHN 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31"/>Mariyami kup'iyosh waat́ mootse binton towat beyiru ayhudiwots Mariyam kaaron tuwat bkesho bek't Alazar doowo maants amr biepetwok'o boosh bíarere b shuutso bo tuwi.<verse eid="JHN 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32"/>Mariyam Iyesus beyirwok waat bín bbek'tsok'on b́ gubrats dihat, «Doonzono, nee hanoke fa'ane wotink'e ti eshu k'irrawk'ee b́ teshi» bi'eti.<verse eid="JHN 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33"/>Iyesuswere bínton waatswotswere boepfere b́bek'tsok'on b́ shayiri fayon shiyanat, <verse eid="JHN 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34"/>«Aawoke bín it duuki?» bíet. Bowere, «Doonzono! waa s'iile» boet.<verse eid="JHN 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35"/>Iyesuswere bí áác'uwo b́kuut'i. <verse eid="JHN 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36"/>Mansh Ayhudiwots, «Aawk'o bín b́shunfok'o s'iilere» boet.<verse eid="JHN 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37"/>Boyitsi ik ikwotsmo, «Ááwdogo ááwo kashitsan, ashaan b́k'irrawok'o woshomawiyank'a b́teshi?» bo eti.<verse eid="JHN 11:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus Alazari k'irotse b́tuztsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38"/>Iyesus ayidek't shiyanefere doowo maants bíami, dowonwere shútson ipeek shúts gop'a b́tesh. <verse eid="JHN 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39"/>Iyesus, «Shútsman k'aa'úbayere» bí eti. K'irtso mish Martaá, «Doonzono b́ k'irihakon awd aawo wotere, and b́ sháák'o shok'etwe» biet. <verse eid="JHN 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40"/>Iyesuswere, «Niamaniyalee Ik'o mangone bek'etune eratstáá neesha?» bíet. <verse eid="JHN 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41"/>Ashuwotswere shútso k'aaú bobazi, maniyere hakon Iyesus dambaan s'iilt, «Nihono! taan n shishtsosh mango neesh boree, <verse eid="JHN 11:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42"/>Jam aawonor taan nshishetwok'o danfee, ernmó han ti et, hanoke need'iru ashuwots taan nee nwoshtsok'o bo amanisha etaatniye» bíet. <verse eid="JHN 11:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43"/>Iyesus man b́keeswihakon «Alazaroo! waa kee!» ett k'áári eenon b́keewi. <verse eid="JHN 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44"/>K'irtso Alazarwere b́ kishwotsnat b́ tufwotsn duuni tahon bo t'at'etsok'on dowootse b́ keshi, b́shitsonwere tahon b́t'at'etsok'ona botesh, Iyesuswere, «Bín bish k'rore, amee!» bí eti.<verse eid="JHN 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus ats malets málo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat. 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mar. 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk'. 22:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45"/>Mariyami ang kup'iyosh wáát teshts ayhudi wotsitse ayuwots b́k'altso bek't Iyesusn boamani. <verse eid="JHN 11:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46"/>Ik ikwotsmo ferisawino eteefwotsok amt́ Iyesus b́ k'altso boosh bo keewi. <verse eid="JHN 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47"/>Mansh kahni naashwotsnat ferisawino eteefwots moosh mooshirwotsi kakudek't hank'o boet, «Ashaan ay adits keewwotsi b́ finirwotse awuk'o nok'alink'e k'úna b́k'aniti? <verse eid="JHN 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48"/>S'ker hank'on bín k'aynok'riyalo ashjamo bín amanitwe, Rom dats ashuwots wáár no beyokonat no ash jamo ishbazetune.»<verse eid="JHN 11:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49"/>Ernmó boyitsi iko mandúr kahni naashwotsatsi k'aabo K'eyaf hank'owa bíet, «It eegor danatste, <verse eid="JHN 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50"/>Ashjamo b́t'afoniyere ik asho ashjami shegro b́k'iro itsh b́k'anitwok'o b́jamon t'iwintsratsteya?» <verse eid="JHN 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51"/>Bí man b́ keew b́ took danonali b́tesh, mandúr bí kahni naash abaatsi k'aabo b́teshtsotsena, Iyesus ayhudi ashuwots shegro b́k'irtwok'o kitsosha bek'han b́keewi. <verse eid="JHN 11:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52"/>B́k'iritwere ayhudiwots mec'rosh b́woterawo, bad'ts Ik'inana'úwotsnowere ikok kakwosha b́tesh.<verse eid="JHN 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53"/>Mansh manots aawotstson Iyesusi bo'úd'itwok'o shiyebowts. <verse eid="JHN 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54"/>Maniyakon Iyesus ayhudiwots dagotse be'at anaaneratse b́tesh, ernmó manoke kesht worwi ganoke fa'a Efremi eteef kitu maants bíami, manokno b́danifwotsnton k'az b́ oori.<verse eid="JHN 11:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55"/>Ayhudi Fazig baaliyo t'intnib́teshi, boyitsi ayuwotswere fazigi baliyiman b́bodfetso botoko s'ayintsosh gat'ariyon Iyerusalem maants bowáá. <verse eid="JHN 11:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56"/>Bowere Ik' mootse need'dek't Iyesus b́wááfetso bokotfotse, «Eebi it asaabiri? Baliyoke areratsa itsha?» Ett boatsatsewo bo aatefrera botesh. <verse eid="JHN 11:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57"/>Ando kahni naashwotsnat ferisawiwotsn Iyesusi detso bofalitwok'o b́beyoko dants asho b́ beyal boosh b́kitsitwok'o ashjamosh azazatni botesh.<verse eid="JHN 11:57"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesusats shitúwo fuutts máátsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat. 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mar. 14:3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1"/>Ayhudi fazigi worwoti baaliy aawo bodosh shirt aawo b́ oortsok'on, Iyesus Bitaniy maants bíami, Bitaniyo Iyesus k'irotse b́tuuztso Alazar b́beef galuni bteshi. <verse eid="JHN 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2"/>Manoknowere kooc'misho bísh k'aniibok'ri, manoknowere finiru Martayi btesh, Alazarwe mishimarats t'intswotsitsi ikoni b́teshi. <verse eid="JHN 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 7:37-38">Luk'. 7:37-38</ref> </char></note> Manoor Mariyam b́ gizo ayidek't shaaw wottso Nardosiya eteets mitatse dozets shituwo ik t'armusi bado wotitwo ik b́lk'at'iyo dek'amaat bín Iyesus tufo fuutbk'ri, b toks'ironowere firbbazi, maa manwere shitú sháák'on s'een b́gutsi. <verse eid="JHN 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4"/>B́ danifwotsitsi iko Iyesusi beshide imetwo Keriyot datstso Yhud, <verse eid="JHN 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5"/>«Shituwan keez bal dinriyosh kemde b́ gizman t'owwotssh imok'aze eegishe?» bíet. <verse eid="JHN 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6"/>Bí man b́ keewwere, t'owwotssh maac'o k'ewatni woterawo, bí úmp'ets b́wottsosha b́tesh, gizi k'arc'ito detsfo bí b́teshtsotse k'arc'itots gedets gizo dek'o danb́dek'tsosha b́tesh.<verse eid="JHN 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7"/>Iyesus hank'owa bíet, «T duuket aawosh b k'anitsotse bine k'ayere. <verse eid="JHN 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:8 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 15:11">Iwi. 15:11</ref> </char></note> T'owwotsiye jam aawo itntoniye bofa'oni, taamó úni aawo itntoniyaliye t beeti.»<verse eid="JHN 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9"/>Manoor ayhudiwotsitse ayuwots Iyesus Bitanin b́ fa'ok'o dank'rat boweyi, bowaatsonwere Iyesus mec'rosh b́woterawon Iyesus k'irotse b́tuuztso Alazarnowere bek'osha b́tesh. <verse eid="JHN 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10"/>Kahni naashwotsmó Alazarnor úd'osh bo shiyeyi. <verse eid="JHN 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11"/>Bíyatse tuutson ayhudiwotsitse aywots amt Iyesusi bo amantsotsna.<verse eid="JHN 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12"/>Yatsok'on fazig baaliyosh waats ay ashuwots Iyesus Iyerusalem maants b́weetwok'o shishbok'ri. <verse eid="JHN 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:25-26">Dub. 118:25-26</ref> </char></note> Mansh woli maaro detsdek't bín mangon dek'osh bokeshi, «Hosa'ana! doonzo shúútson wetwo Isra'el naasho deereke!» etfetst bokuhefere botesh.<verse eid="JHN 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14"/>Iyesus daaz na'o daatsdek't bíats beeb́dek'i, man b́ wotwere,<verse eid="JHN 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:15 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Zek. 9:9</ref> </char>
    </note> «Nee S'iyon ni'e, Iyerusaleme shatk'aye!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:15">Hambe! n naashoniye daaz na'ú ats keede'er weetwe»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 12:15">ett bek'on guut'etso b́ s'eenetwok'owe.<verse eid="JHN 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16"/>B́ danifwotssh keewan bal boosh galeratse b́tesh, ernmó Iyesus b́mangiyakon keewan b́jangosh b́guut'etsok'onat bísho k'aletsok'o gawbodek'i.<verse eid="JHN 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17"/>Iyesus Alazari dowootse s'eegt k'irotse b́tuuzor bínton teshts jamwots Iyesus jango bogefera botesh. <verse eid="JHN 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18"/>Ay ashuwots bínton gonkewosh bowowwere adits keewan b́finetsok'o shisht boteshtsosha. <verse eid="JHN 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19"/>Manoor Ferisawino eteetswots, «Eshe! dats jamatsi ash jamo b́shuutso tuure! noo eegor k'alo no maawtsok'o bek'irutosha?» Bo ats atsewosh boet.<verse eid="JHN 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20"/>Baalyi aawor Ik' k'onosh Iyerusalem maants amts ashuwotsitse, Grik datson watswots bítse fa'ano botesh. <verse eid="JHN 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21"/>Bowere Gelil datsatse Betesayid galits ash wottso Flip'osok t'iindek't, «T doonzo! Iyesusi bek'o geefone» boeti.<verse eid="JHN 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22"/>Filip'oswere amt́ Indriyassh keew b́k'ri, Indriyasnat Filip'osn towat amt Iyesussh keew bok'ri. <verse eid="JHN 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23"/>Iyesuswere hank'o ett boosh b́keewi, «Hamb ashna'o b́mangit sa'ato bodre, <verse eid="JHN 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:24 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mat. 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:25">16:25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:35">Mar. 8:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:24">Luk'. 9:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">17:33</ref> </char></note> Arikon aroniye itsh tietiri, Sndeyi ááwu datsats fed'ar b k'iriyalabako biaaliye b ooriti, bk'iriyalmó ayo shuwitwane. <verse eid="JHN 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25"/>B́kashu shuntso bin t'afitwe, datsanatse b́kashú shit'etwonmó dúre dúri beyosh gerdek'etwe. <verse eid="JHN 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26"/>Taash finosh geyirwo t shuutso wowe, taash fiintwonwere taa tbeyrwok beetwe, taash fiinitwonowere t nihi bímangitwee.»<verse eid="JHN 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27"/>Maniyak Iyesus hank'o bí et, «And eshe! t kashu kic'wtseraniyee, awk'oye ti'eteti eshna? Nihono! sa'atanatse taan fariwe erta? Man tierawok'o taa twaa kic'its gond bek'i sa'atanshee. <verse eid="JHN 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28"/>Nihono! n shútso mangiwe.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:28">Maniye il «Tshútso mangire, aaninwere mangitwe!» etts k'iro darotse b́weyi.<verse eid="JHN 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29"/>Manoke need'iru ashuwots man boshishtsok'on, «Guumee!» boet. K'atsetswotswere, «Melakiye kewtsoni!» bo eti.<verse eid="JHN 12:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30"/>Iyesusmó hank'o ett bíaaniy, «K'aaran b́weyiye itsha ettni bako taasha ettniyaliye, <verse eid="JHN 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31"/>Datsanats angshet andee, datsani keewts Shed'ano úromaants b́juwet andee, <verse eid="JHN 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32"/>Taawere datswatse dambaan dambaan taan k'aúwewor ashjamo t maants geetsitwe.» <verse eid="JHN 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33"/>Iyesus han b́keewtsonwere ááw naari k'iron bk'iritwok'o kitsosha.<verse eid="JHN 12:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:34 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PSA 110:4">Dub. 110:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:7">Isa. 9:7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:25">Hzk'. 37:25</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:14">Dan. 7:14</ref> </char>
    </note> Ashuwotswere «Nemotse guut'ere nodatstsok'osh ‹Krstos dúre dúeosh beetwe› etke, ‹eshe nee, ash na'o dambaan dambaan tuwitwe› nietiri aawk'oneya? Ash na'amanmo kone?» boeti.<verse eid="JHN 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35"/>Iyesus hank'o boosh bíet, «And muk'na'a gizeyosh shááno itnton fa'ee, t'aluwo itats b́borawok'o shááno itsh b́befere ananore, t'aluwots sha'efo aawok bíamirwok'owo danatse. <verse eid="JHN 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36"/>Shááno nana'uwotsi it wotitwok'o shááno itsh b́befere sháánman amanore,» Iyesus man b́keewiyakon amt boatse áásh b́wtsi.<verse eid="JHN 12:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ayhudiwots amano bok'aztsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37"/>Iyesus ay adits keewwotsi boshinatse b́ fiiniyaloru ayhudiwots bín amaneratsno. <verse eid="JHN 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:38 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">Isa. 53:1</ref> </char></note> Man b́wotirwere Nebiyiyo Isayasn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">«Doonzono! no keewtso kone amani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">Doonzo angonmó konshe b́be'eyi?»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 12:38">Ett b́keewtso b́s'eenishe. <verse eid="JHN 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39"/>Hanatse tuutso Isayas bíettsok'on amano maawrne.<verse eid="JHN 12:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:40 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 6:10">Isa. 6:10</ref> </char>
    </note> «Bo ááwoń be'efetsr</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">Bonibotse t'iwintsr</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">Boaanere boon b́kashirawok'o</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">Ik'o bo ááwo deekb́k'rere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">Bonibonowere dungik'rere.»<verse eid="JHN 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41"/>Isasayas han bíetiye Iyesus mango b́bek'etsoshe, manshe han Iyesus jangoshe b́keewiri.<verse eid="JHN 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42"/>B́wotefere Ayhudi naashwotsitse dab ayuwots Iyesusn amanerno, ernmó Ferisawino eteefwots Ik' k'oni mootse boon bokishrawok'o shatt b́ jango sháánon kish keewratsno. <verse eid="JHN 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43"/>Man bok'alwere Ik'oke daatset mangoniyere ashoke daatset mango boshuntsotsne.<verse eid="JHN 12:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44"/>Iyesuswere b́k'aáro eenshdek't hank'o etre, «Taan amantso t s'uzi b́ woterawo, taan woshtsonowere amanirwe, <verse eid="JHN 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45"/>Taan bek'irwonwere taan woshtso bek'irwe, <verse eid="JHN 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46"/>Taan amanit jamo t'aluwotse b́berawok'o taa sháán wotat datsats waare. <verse eid="JHN 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47"/>Ti aap'tso k'ewde finats jitsrawats angshitwo taanaliye, taa t weyiye datsu kashiyisha bako datsats angshoshashaliye. <verse eid="JHN 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48"/>Taan geerawonat t aap'ono de'aw ashaats angshitwo fa'ee, taa t keewts aap'o dúri s'uwatse bíats angshitwe. <verse eid="JHN 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49"/>Taa t took alon keewratse, taa tietirwonat tkeewts tzaziyono taash imtso taan woshtso Aabiye. <verse eid="JHN 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50"/>Bí alonwere dúre dúri kasho b́wottsok'o danfee. Mansh taa tkeewirwo niho aab taash b́ keewtsoniye.»<verse eid="JHN 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesus b́ danifwots tufo b́mashtsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1"/>Manoronú fazigi baaliyoniyre shina b́ tesh, Iyesus datsani k'ayr nihok bíamet aawo b́bodtsok'o danb́k'ri. Datsanatse fa'a b́jirwotsi shunk'ratni b́tesh, b́jamoonowere shunb́k'ri.<verse eid="JHN 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2"/>Iyesusnat b́danfwots kooc'misho bomefera boteshi, Simon naay Kiriyot dats asho Yihudmó Iyesusi beshide b́'imetwok'o Diyablos b́nibots gond keewo gedb́k'ri. <verse eid="JHN 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3"/>Niho al jamo bísh bí imtsok'onat Ik'oke kesht b́waatsok'o, Ik'o maantso aanar bíametwok'o Iyesus danfee b́teshi, <verse eid="JHN 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4"/>Mansh mishimaratse k'aztuut b́shemo dats gedb́k'ri, bín firet taho k'aaúdek't b́gebats edb́dek'i. <verse eid="JHN 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5"/>Maniyere il tufmashi k'ac'ots aatso geddek't b́danifwots tufo masho dek'b́tu, b́ ed'ts tahmannowere botufo b́fir. <verse eid="JHN 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6"/>Iyesuswere Simon P'et'rosok b́waatsok'on Simon P'et'ros, «Doonzono! neene t tufo masheti?» bí et. <verse eid="JHN 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7"/>Iyesuswere «Taa t k'alirwo nee and danatsne, aytsmo t'iwintsitune» bíet <verse eid="JHN 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8"/>P'etroswere «Nee t tufo b́jamon mayatsne!» bí et. Iyesuswere «Taa n tufo masho tk'azal nee tiyoke bano deshatsne» ett bí aaniyi. <verse eid="JHN 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9"/>Simon P'et'roswere «Doonzono! mank'oyi wotiyal bére ttufmec'ro b́woterawo tkishonowere, ttookonowere maye!» bí eti. <verse eid="JHN 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10"/>Iyesuswere «Bí aats mashtso b́ jamon s'ayin b́wottsotse b́ tuf mashoniye okoon k'osho geyiratse, itwere s'ayinwots itne, ernmó it únetsiyaliye» bí eti. <verse eid="JHN 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11"/>Iyesus «It únets s'ayin itnaliye» bíet bín beshide imetwo koni b́wottsok'o b́ dantsosha b́ tesh.<verse eid="JHN 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:12 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="LUK 22:27">Luk'. 22:27</ref> </char>
    </note> Botufo b́ mashiyakon b́ taho tahdek't b́ beyok aanat beebdek'i, hank'owo boosh bíet, «Itsh eeg t k'altsok'o t'iwints dek'rteya? <verse eid="JHN 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13"/>It ‹Danifonat doonoza› etfte taasha, taa danifonat doonzo twottsotse it ettso aree. <verse eid="JHN 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14"/>Eshe taa itsh doonznat iti danifo wotefetsat it tufo t mashihakon it it atsatsewosh it tufo masheyo geyitwe. <verse eid="JHN 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15"/>Taa itsh tk'altsok'o itwere it k'alitwok'o ariyosh wotitwo itsh beezree. <verse eid="JHN 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:16 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 10:24">Mat. 10:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:40">Luk'. 6:40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:20">Yoh. 15:20</ref> </char></note> Aron arikone itsh keewirwe, guutso b́ doonzoniyere bowakee, wooshetsonwere bín woshtsoniyere bowakee. <verse eid="JHN 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17"/>Keewan dande finats it jitsink'ere derek itne. <verse eid="JHN 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:18 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Dub. 41:9</ref> </char></note> Han tkeewir it únetsishaliye, taa t galdek'tswotsi danfee, ernmó ‹T mish máátso gondon tiatsats tuure› etiru S'ayin mas'aafotse beyiru aap'o b́s'eeno geyife. <verse eid="JHN 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19"/>Man b́wotoniyere shino itsh t keewiri, b́ s'eeniyakon taa Bín twottsok'o it amanishee. <verse eid="JHN 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:20 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mat. 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:37">Mar. 9:37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:48">Luk'. 9:48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:16">10:16</ref> </char></note> Arikon aronee itsh t keewiri, taa t woshtso dek'etwoniye taan de'k'etwe, taano dek'etwo taan woshtsonowere dek'etwe.»<verse eid="JHN 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus bín beshide imetwo koni b́wottsok'owo shino b́keewtsok'o.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Mat. 26:20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Mar. 14:17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luk'. 22:21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21"/>Iyesus man bí etiyakon b́ shayiron kic'at «Aron, arikoniye itsh t etiri, ititsi iko taan beshide imetwe» et kishdek't b́keewi.<verse eid="JHN 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22"/>B́ danifwots b́ keewirwan kon jango b́wottsok'o bodartsotse bo atsatsewo bos'ile. <verse eid="JHN 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23"/>Iyesus b́danifwotsitsi b́shnf iko Iyesus ganokt bedek'tni b́tesh. <verse eid="JHN 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24"/>Simon P'et'ros kolat, «Konjango b́keewtsok'o aab aatwe» bí eti.<verse eid="JHN 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25"/>Mann bí Iyesusok t'intsdek't «Doonzono! neen beshide imetwo kone?» ett bíaati.<verse eid="JHN 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26"/>Iyesuswere «Bíye mishan iton itde bísh ti'imetwoniye» bí eti. Man bí'ettsok'on misho iton itdek't Kiriyot ash wottso Simon naay Yihudsh b́ imi. <verse eid="JHN 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27"/>Yihud imetsman b́dek'iyakon manoor Shed'no bíatsots s'een b́utsi, Iyesuswere Yihudsh, «K'alosh ngeyirwo káári k'alwe!» bí et. <verse eid="JHN 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28"/>Iyesus eegosh mank'o bíettsok'o mishimaratse beyirwotsitse konwor dantso aali b́tesh. <verse eid="JHN 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29"/>Yihud giz detsfo b́teshtsotse b́ danifwotsitsi ik ikwots Iyesus «Baliyosh noosh geyitwo keewowe wee t'owwotssh ime» bíettsok'owa boosh bíari.<verse eid="JHN 13:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30"/>Yihdwere tiits imetsman b́dek'tsok'on manoor kesht k'az bíami. Manoronwere t'úwa b́tesh.<verse eid="JHN 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Handr tzaziyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31"/>Yihud kesht bí amiyakon Iyesus hank'o bíeti, «And ash Na'o mangree, b́ yatse tuutsonowere Ik'o mangree, <verse eid="JHN 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32"/>Ik'o b́jangatse tuutson b́mangtsotse Ik'onwere bín mangitwe, muk'i b́teyawoniye bín b́mangitye. <verse eid="JHN 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:33 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 7:34">Yoh. 7:34</ref> </char></note> T nanaúwotso! itnton tteshet ay gizeyoshaliye, itwere taan geyitute, Ayhudi naashwotssh ‹Taa tiametwok it woo falratste› ti ettsok'o, andoor itsh mank'o eteetwe. <verse eid="JHN 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:34 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 15:12">Yoh. 15:12</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 15:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:23">1 Yoh. 3:23</ref>; <ref loc="2JN 1:5">2 Yoh. 5</ref> </char></note> It atsatsewo it shuneetwok'o handr tzaziwo itsh imirwe, taa itn tshuntsok'o itwere it atsatsewo shunewere. <verse eid="JHN 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35"/>It atsatsewo it shunetka wotiyal t danifwotsi it wottsok'o ash jamo danetwe.»<verse eid="JHN 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'et'ros bín bíhalitwok'o Iyesus shino b́keewtsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat. 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mar. 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk'. 22:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36"/>Maniyere il S'mon P'et'ros Iyesussh, «Doonzono! aawke niameti?» ett bíaati.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:36">Iyesuswere «taa tiametwok and taanton woo falratsne ilmó tshuutso woo falitune» ett bíaniyi <verse eid="JHN 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37"/>P'et'roswere «Doonzono! eegoshe and nshuutso woo tmawiti? Taa t kasho dab neesha err beshide ímetwe» bí et.<verse eid="JHN 13:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38"/>Iyesuwere «Nee nkasho taasha err beshide imetwiya? Aron arikoniye neesh ti etiri, hambets baako b́ k'ad́ftsere shino keezoto taan haalitune» ett bíaaniy.<verse eid="JHN 13:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14"/>
  <para style="s">B́ nihok de'amet weerindo Iyesus s'uzi b́wottsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1"/>Manats dabt Iyesus hank'owa bíet, «Kic'k'ayere, Ik'on amanore, taanowere amanore, <verse eid="JHN 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2"/>Tnih mootse ay beewoke fa'oni, mank'o wotob́k'azink'eremó it beetwoko k'aniyosh ametuwe erawnk'e b́teshi. <verse eid="JHN 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3"/>Amr beyoko itsh t k'aniyakon taa t beyirwoke itwere it beetwok'o aanar waar itn dek'etwe. <verse eid="JHN 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4"/>Taa ti amiru werindonoewere danfte.»<verse eid="JHN 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5"/>Tomaswere «Doonzono! aawok niamirwok'o danatsone, eshe, weerindo awuk'o k'alrniya dano nofaliti?» bíet. <verse eid="JHN 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6"/>Iyesuswere hank'o et bísh bíaaniy, «Weronu aronu kashonu taane, t weerona bako konwor nihok bodetwo aaliye. <verse eid="JHN 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7"/>Taan danrte wotink'e tnihnowere danank'te b́teshi, hanyakomó bín danetute, bínowere bek'rte.»<verse eid="JHN 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8"/>Filip'oswere «Doonzono! niho noosh nkitsitka wotiyal noosh bodfe» bíet.<verse eid="JHN 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9"/>Iyesuswere hank'o et bísh bíaaniy, «Filip'osoo! hank'o dúro itnton tbeyiru jamanitsneya taan itdari? taan bek'tsoniye nihono bek're, eshe, nee ‹niho noosh kitsuwe› nietir awuk'neya? <verse eid="JHN 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10"/>Taa nihots t beyirwok'o, nihonwere tiyits b́bewok'o amaneratsiya? itsh tkeewiru keewo ttookonaliye, ernmó fin jamo finirwo tgiyitse fa'o nihoniye, <verse eid="JHN 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11"/>Taa nihotse t beyirwok'o, nihonwere tiyitse b́fa'ok'owo amanore, mank'o woto b́ k'azalor tfinatse tuutson taan amanore. <verse eid="JHN 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12"/>Arikon aroniye itsh ti etiri, taan amanitwo taa tfiniru fino finitwe, dab haniyere bogo finitwe, taa nihok ametuwe. <verse eid="JHN 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13"/>Niho Nayoatse tuutson b́mangitwok'o t shútson itk'onitu jamo itsh k'alitwe. <verse eid="JHN 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14"/>Konnor wotowa t shútson it k'onit keewo taa k'alitwe.<verse eid="JHN 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus S'ayin shayiro imosh b́jangitsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15"/>«Taan shunfte wotiyal t tzaziyo kotetuute, <verse eid="JHN 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16"/>Taa niho k'onitwe, bíwere dúre dúrosh itnton beetwo k'osho kup'shitwo itsh imetwe. <verse eid="JHN 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17"/>Hanwere S'ayin Shayir arikoniye, datsan bín b́dawonat b́be'awotse bín dek'o falratse, itmó bí itnton b́wottsotsnat it gitsotsnowere b́beyirwotse bín danfte.<verse eid="JHN 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18"/>«Indonat nih deshaw nana'uwotskok'o it aali k'ayk'reratse, aanar itmand weetwe. <verse eid="JHN 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19"/>Muk' gizewoniyakon datsu taan be'atsaa, itmó taan bek'etute, taa beyarr beetk twottsotse itwere beyar beetute beetute. <verse eid="JHN 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20"/>Taa nihots tbeyirwok'o itwere tiyitse it fa'ok'o, taawere ititse t fa'ok'owo manots aawots danetute.<verse eid="JHN 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21"/>«Taan shuntsoniye t tzaziyo dek'etwonat finats jitsitwoniyee, taan shuntsoneye t nihi shunfee, taawere bín shunfee, t tokonowere bísh kitsitwe.»<verse eid="JHN 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22"/>Kiriyot dats ash woterawo k'osho Yhud, «T doonzo! n tooko datsjamosh nkitsrawo noosh nkitsit aawk'oneya?» bí eti.<verse eid="JHN 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23"/>Iyesuswere bísh hank'o ett bíaaniy, «Taan shuntso ti aap'tso kordek'etwee, tnihwere bín shunfee, noo bíyok wáár bínton towaar beetwone. <verse eid="JHN 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24"/>Taan shunawo t aap'o kóratse, and it k'ebiru aap'an taan woshtso nihoka bako tikaliye.<verse eid="JHN 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25"/>«And itnton befetsat keewan itsh keewre, <verse eid="JHN 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26"/>Niho t shútson b́woshitwo kup'shitwo S'ayin shayironmó jamkeewo itsh danitwe, taa itsh t keewts jamonowere t'iwints itdek'etwok'o woshitwe.<verse eid="JHN 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27"/>«Jeeno itok k'ayk'ritwe, t jeenonowere itsh imetwe, taa itsh t imet jenoniye datsan bimetwok'owiyaliye, kic' k'ayere, ando shatk'ayere. <verse eid="JHN 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28"/>‹Taa ametuwe, anarnwe itok weetwe› ti ettsok'o shishrte, t nih taayere b́bogtsotse taan it shunink'e nihok ti amor geneúwiyank'te b́teshi. <verse eid="JHN 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29"/>Han b́wotor it amanitwok'o, shino b́ woteftsere itsh keewre, <verse eid="JHN 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30"/>Datsani keewtso Shed'ano b́weyirwotse haniyere okoon itnton ay keeweratse. Bíye tiatse eegor alo deshatse, <verse eid="JHN 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31"/>Ernmó taa niho t shuntsok'o datso b́danetwok'o taan bíazazts jamo s'eentsitwe, tuuwere hanoke amone.<verse eid="JHN 14:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesus ari weyini k'omboniye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1"/>«Ariko weyini k'ombo taane, mitwotsi goshtso tnihiye, <verse eid="JHN 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2"/>Ti atse fa'o shuu shuraw jabjamwotsi tnih k'ut'de juuk'ritwe, shuu shuwitu jaabo ayide b́shuwitwok'o k'anzde'er s'ayintsitwe. <verse eid="JHN 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3"/>Itwere itsh tiaap'ts aap'atse tuutson and s'ayinwots itne. <verse eid="JHN 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4"/>Taan beewere,, taawere itn beetwe, jaabo weyini k'ombats kup'ar beeratse wotiyal biyal shuu shuwo b́falrawok'owa itwoor taan beyo itk'azal shuu shuwo falratste.<verse eid="JHN 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5"/>«Taa weyini k'ombo taane, itwere jaabwots itne, ti ats deshar beetwonat taawere bín t beetwoniye ay shuwo shuwitwee, eshe ti'aalo eegor k'alo falratste. <verse eid="JHN 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6"/>Tiats deshar beerawo jaabwots uromaants juwere b́shuk'eti. Mank'o wottso jabwotsi kakude'er taawots juwere bomis'eti. <verse eid="JHN 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7"/>Taan itbeyink'e ti aap'tswotswere ititse bobeyink'ere itgeyiru jamo itk'onor daatsitute. <verse eid="JHN 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8"/>Ay shuwo it shuwink'ere manatse tuutson t nih mangiyank'ee, itwere t danifwotsi it wottsok'o kitsiyank'te. <verse eid="JHN 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9"/>Niho taan b́shuntsok'o taawere itn shunre, manshe tshunon beewere,. <verse eid="JHN 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10"/>Taa t nih tzaziyo t kottsok'onat b́ shunon t beyirwok'o itwere ti tzaziyo it kotal t shunon beetute. <verse eid="JHN 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11"/>Jaman itsh tkeewiye tgeneeú'wo ititse wotar it geneúwo s'een b́wotishe. <verse eid="JHN 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:12 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 13:34">Yoh. 13:34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:17">15:17</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:23">1 Yoh. 3:23</ref>; <ref loc="2JN 1:5">2 Yoh. 5</ref> </char></note> T tzaziyoniye taa iti t shuntsok'o itiwere it atsatseyo it shunetwok'owe. <verse eid="JHN 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13"/>Asho b́ kasho b́ mashots shegro beshide imoniyere bogts shuno deshatse. <verse eid="JHN 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14"/>Itwere ti imts tzaziyo it s'eentsiyal t mashots itne. <verse eid="JHN 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15"/>Guutso doonzo b́finirwo b́danawotse, haniyere hakon guutswotso eraatse, s'uznmó tnihoke tshishts jamo itsh tkitstsotse t mashotsi etreitsha, <verse eid="JHN 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16"/>Taana iti marat'dek'i bako it taan marat'de'atste, amr ay shuwo itshuwitwok'o, itshuwonwere beetk b́wotitwok'o itn tnaashiy. Manshe niho t shútson it k'onts jamo itsh imetwe. <verse eid="JHN 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17"/>Eshe taa itin tiazazir it atsatsewo it shunetwok'owe.<verse eid="JHN 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus dats shit'i jango b́keewtsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18"/>«Datsan itn b́ shit'al itiyere shino taan b́shit'tsok'o dande'ere. <verse eid="JHN 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19"/>Datsank it wotink'ere datsan b́tokk wottswotsi shunak'e b́teshi. Ernmó datsank woto it k'aztsotsnat taa datsanatse iti marat' t dek'tsosh datsan itn shit'etwee. <verse eid="JHN 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:20 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 10:24">Mat. 10:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:40">Luk'. 6:40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:16">Yoh. 13:16</ref> </char></note> Guutso doonzoniyre bowatse etaat itsh t keewtso gawwre, taan bogiishitka wotiyal itnowere gishitune, ti aap'o bokotink'e it aap'ono kotetune. <verse eid="JHN 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21"/>Taan woshtso bodanawotse t jangosh jaman itats k'alitunee. <verse eid="JHN 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22"/>Taa waat boosh keewratse wotink'e morro boats woteratse b́teshi, ernmó and bo morrosh weebo deshatsne. <verse eid="JHN 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23"/>Taan shit'irwo t nihnowere b́ shit'iri, <verse eid="JHN 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24"/>K'osh ash fineraw fino bo dagotse fino tk'azink'ere morro boosh woteratse b́ teshi, andmó jaman bobek'iyakon taano t nihno shit'rne. <verse eid="JHN 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25"/>Hanwere b́ wottso ‹Ik jagalo taan shit'rne› ett nemotse guut'etso b́ s'eenetwok'owe.<verse eid="JHN 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26"/>«Ernmó nihoke keshetwonat taawere nihoke itsh twoshitwo itn kup'itwo ari S'ayn shayiro b́ woor bí t jango gawitwe. <verse eid="JHN 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27"/>Itwere baltson tuwat taanton it teshtsotse gawitute.<verse eid="JHN 15:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1"/>«Hambe, jaman itsh t keew it imnetiyatse it giwawok'owa etaatniye. <verse eid="JHN 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2"/>Ayhudiyots Ik' k'oni mootse kishder iti gishitno, mank'o itn ud'itu jamwots dab́ Ik'osh bofinirwok'o boosh bí arit aawo weetwe. <verse eid="JHN 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3"/>Hanowere bok'alir nihono taano bodanawotsene. <verse eid="JHN 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4"/>Han itsh tkeewiriye bíaawo b́bodor itsh eeg tkeewtsok'o gaw itdekishe.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">Jaman haniyere shin itsh keewo tk'aziye itnton t teshtsotsne.<verse eid="JHN 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">S'ayin shayiri fino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5"/>«Andmó taan woshtsok amishee, b́wotiyalor ititse ‹Eewke niameti› err taan aatitwo aaliye. <verse eid="JHN 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6"/>Jaman itsh t keewtsotse it nibo shiyanon s'eenwtsere. <verse eid="JHN 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7"/>Taamó arikon aroniye itsh tietiriye, ti amo itsh k'anefe, taa amo t k'azal kup'shitwo itook waratse, taa tiamalmó bín itsh deyitwe. <verse eid="JHN 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8"/>Bí b́woor morri jangosh, kááw woti jango, angshi jangosho datsatsi ashuwotsi wok'asitwe. <verse eid="JHN 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9"/>Morri jango b́ kitsitiye taan amano bok'azirwoshe. <verse eid="JHN 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10"/>Kááw woti jango kish b́ kitsitiye niho maants tiametwonat haniye haniyak taan bek'o it k'azetwoshe, <verse eid="JHN 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11"/>Angshi jango kish b́kitsit datsan keewtsoats angshetsoshe.<verse eid="JHN 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12"/>«Itsh t keewitwo andoor ay keewo detsfe, ernmó and itatse b́mangiti, <verse eid="JHN 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13"/>Arik wotts Shayiro b́ woor ar jamo maants itn jishitwe. Bí b́ keewitwo b́ shishtsoni bako b́tokk woto b́ k'aztsotse bí shinomaants wotit keewo itsh keewitwe. <verse eid="JHN 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14"/>Tik wottsotse de'er itsh b́keitwotse taan mangitwe. <verse eid="JHN 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15"/>Nihok wotts jamo tikee, ‹Tik wottso de'er itsh keewitwe› ti et manshe.<verse eid="JHN 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">It shiyano gene'úwo maants b́wonetwok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16"/>«Muk'i it teshiyakon taan be'atste, ando muk'i it teshiyakon taan bek'etute.»<verse eid="JHN 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17"/>B́ danifwotsitse ik ikwots, «Han, ‹Muk'i b́ teshihakon taan be'atste, ando muk'i it teshihakon taan bek'etute, ando aani nihomaants ametuwe› b́ etiru keewo eebi?» ett boatsatseyo bo aateyi. <verse eid="JHN 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18"/>«Eshe han ‹Muk'i b́teshihakon› bí etiru keewo eebi? B́ keewiru keewo danatsone» ett anansh dek't́ boaateyi.<verse eid="JHN 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19"/>Iyesuswere bín aatosh bogeyirwok'o dank'rat hank'o boosh bíet, «It atsatseyo it aateyirwo, ‹Muk'i b́ teshiyakon taan be'atste, ando aani múk'ibteshiyakon taan bek'etute,› ti ettsosheya? <verse eid="JHN 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20"/>Ariko aron itsh etirwe, it eepetutee, kuhitutee, datsanmó genee'uwitwee, it shiyanitute, ernmó it shiyano gene'o maants woneetwe. <verse eid="JHN 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21"/>Máátsu bshuwor b shambi aawo b́bodtsotse shiyanitwaniye, bshuwihakonmó datsats na'i marmat'o bshuwetsotse bgene'utsatse tuutson bali b kic'o gawratsaniye. <verse eid="JHN 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22"/>Mank'o and it shiyanitute, ernmó taa aani iti bek'etwe, it mac'onwere gene'uitwe, it gene'uwere itatse dek'etwo aaliye.<verse eid="JHN 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23"/>«Manots aawots tiyoke eegor k'onratste, ariko arikon itsh etirwe niho tshútson it k'oniyal jam keewo itsh ímetwe. <verse eid="JHN 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24"/>Han b́ borfetsosh t shútson eegor ik keewo k'onrafa'atee, it k'oniyal itsh imetwe, mannowere it gene'uo s'een wotitwe.<verse eid="JHN 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25"/>«Andish b́borfetso jewron itsh keewre, haniyako jewron itsh t keeweraw aawo weetwe, ernmó niho jangosh jam keewo kishde itsh keewitwe. <verse eid="JHN 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26"/>Manots aawots tshútson k'onitute, taawere ‹Niho it jangosh k'onitwe› eraatse. <verse eid="JHN 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27"/>Man eegoshe niho b́tookon iti b́shuntsoshe, nihonwere iti b́shunir taan it shuntsonat Ik'oke twatsok'o it amantsotsne. <verse eid="JHN 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28"/>Nihoke keshat datsats waare, ando aaniy datsani k'ayr nihok ametuwe.»<verse eid="JHN 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29"/>B́danifwotswere hank'owa boet, «Hamb! andee jewron b́woterawon shanone n keewi, <verse eid="JHN 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30"/>Nee jamo n dantsok'onat nee konnwor neesh aato t'intso b́geyirawok'o and t'iwintsdek'roone, mansh Ik'oke keshat n waatsok'o amanirwone.»<verse eid="JHN 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31"/>Iyesuswere boosh hank'o ett bíaaniy, «Andmó amanertya? <verse eid="JHN 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32"/>It ik ikets it kaat kaaton bad'arr tiyali k'ayitk'rit sa'ato weetwe, b́ sa'atonwere andbodre, ernomó niho taanton b́wottsotse tiyaltanaliye. <verse eid="JHN 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33"/>Han itsh tkeewir tiats deshar jeeno it datsitwok'owa etaatniye, datsanatse it befetsosh gondbek'o itaatse'faee, ernmó shatk'ayere, taa datsani da'adek're.»<verse eid="JHN 16:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesus b́danifwotssh Ik'o b́k'ontsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1"/>Iyesus han b́ keewiyakon daromaants b́ tooko tuzdek't s'iilfetst hank'owa bíet, «Nihono! hamb, sa'ato bodre, n naay neen b́ mangiytwok'o n na'o mangiwe, <verse eid="JHN 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2"/>Ni imts jamwotssh dúre dúri kasho b́ imetwok'o ash jamwotsatse alo n imtsoshe. <verse eid="JHN 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3"/>Dúre dúri kashonwere n s'uzi ari Ik'o Izar Izewernat n woshtso Iyesus Krstosi danoniye. <verse eid="JHN 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4"/>Taa taash n'imts fino s'eentsat datsanatse neen mangire. <verse eid="JHN 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5"/>Nihono! datsan bíazeftsere niyoke t detsts mangon taan andoor niyoke mangiwe.<verse eid="JHN 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6"/>«Datsanatse gaaldek'at taash n imts ashuwotssh koni nwotok'o kitsre, booye niknee boteshi, neehe boon taash imrne, boowere ni aap'o kotdek'rne, <verse eid="JHN 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7"/>Taash nímts jamo niyokik b́ wottsok'o bo and danrnee. <verse eid="JHN 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8"/>Taash nimts aap'wotsi boosh imre, boowere t keewre k'ebdek'rne, niyoke keshat twaatsok'onowere arikon danrnee, nee taan n woshtsok'onowere amanernee.<verse eid="JHN 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9"/>«Taa tk'onir bo jangoshe, taash nimtsanots nik bowottsotse bo jangosh k'onirwe, datsush k'onratse. <verse eid="JHN 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10"/>Tik wotts jamo nike, nik wottsonwere tikee, taawere boatse tuutson mangree. <verse eid="JHN 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11"/>Taa haniyakon datsanatse beeratse, bomó datsanatsikne. Taaye nmaants twooniyee, S'ayin nihono taash n'imtsanots nokok'o ik bowotishe taash n'imts nshúútson boon kore. <verse eid="JHN 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12"/>Taa bonton t teshor taash nimts n shúútson boon kotre, taahe boon kotre, mansh mas'aaf S'aynotsitsi aap'etso b́ s'eenetwok'o t'afi na'oniye oko konwor boyitse t'aftso aaliye. <verse eid="JHN 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13"/>And taa n maants t wooniye, datsatse befetsat han boosh t keewir t gene'o boon s'een b́wotitwok'owe. <verse eid="JHN 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14"/>Taa ni aap'o boosh imre, taa datsanatsik wottk'ztsok'o boworu datsatsiknaliye, manshe datsan boon b́ shit'i. <verse eid="JHN 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15"/>Gondatse boon n k'otetwok'owa bako datsatse boon n dek'etwok'o neen k'onratse. <verse eid="JHN 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16"/>Taa datsatsik t woterawok'o boowere datsatsiknaliy. <verse eid="JHN 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17"/>Aron boon S'ayntswe, ni aap'onu aree. <verse eid="JHN 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18"/>Nee taan datsan maants n woshtsok'o taa boon datsan maants woshere. <verse eid="JHN 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19"/>Bo arikon S'ayn bowotitwok'o taa bo jangosh t tooko S'ayin woshitwe.<verse eid="JHN 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20"/>«Bo aap'o k'ebdek't taan amaniru jamwotssha tk'oniri bako, bos'uzsh k'onratse. <verse eid="JHN 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21"/>Taawere t k'onir jametswots ik bowotitwok'we, andoor nihono! nee tiitse nbeyok'o taawere niatse t fa'ok'o, boowere noon bobetwok'o, nee taan nwoshtsok'o datsan b́ amanitwok'owe. <verse eid="JHN 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22"/>Noo ik nowottsok'o boowere ik bowotitwok'o, taash n imts mango boosh imre. <verse eid="JHN 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23"/>Taa t k'onirwo taa boon neewere taan n wottsok'o boowere b́ jamon ik bowotitwok'owe. Mank'owere taan nwoshtsok'onat taan nshuntsok'on bonowere nshuntsok'o datso b́danishe.<verse eid="JHN 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24"/>«Nihono! Datsan bíazeftsere taan nshuntsotse taash n'imts mango bobek'etwok'o taash n ímtsanotswere taa t beyoke taanton bo beyo shunfee. <verse eid="JHN 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25"/>S'ayin nihono! datso neen danatse, taamó neen danfee, hanotswere taan nee n woshtsok'o danrnee. <verse eid="JHN 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26"/>Taan nshunts shuno booke b́betwok'o taawere boats twotitwok'o, boowere neen bodanetwok'o woshre, ando aani bodanetwok'o woshitwe.»<verse eid="JHN 17:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesusi detsdek't beshidek't imetsok'on</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat. 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mar. 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk'. 22:47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1"/>Iyesus hank'o b́ etiyakon b́ danifwotsnton K'edron foki túroniye bak'ets bíami, manoke teshts miti bos'wots beyok b́ danifwotsnton bokind. <verse eid="JHN 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2"/>Iyesusnat b́ danifwotsn jam aawo manoke boko'efotse bín beshide imetwo Yhud manokman danfee b́ tesh. <verse eid="JHN 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3"/>Mansh Yihud, wotadrwotsitsi ik kaywotsi, mank'owere kahni naashwotsitsnat ferisawino eteefwotsitse wosheets kot kotfwotsitse k'atswotsi jishdek't manok b́weyi, boowere fanosiyonat c'eshon, gini k'ac'uwotsi detsdek'tni botesh. <verse eid="JHN 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4"/>Iyesuswere bíats bodetu jamo dank'rat bomaand kesh waat, «Kone it geyirwoni?» bí eti. <verse eid="JHN 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5"/>Bowere «Nazrettso Iyesusiye nogeyiri» boet. Bíwere «Bíye Taane» bí eti. Bín beshide imetwo Yhudwere bonton need'dek'tni b́tesh. <verse eid="JHN 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6"/>Iyesuswere «Bíye taane» bí eree shuutso madand ginaat datsats dih bowts. <verse eid="JHN 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7"/>Iyesuswere, «Kone it geyiri» ett aani boon bíaati. Bowere «Nazrettso Iyesusiye nogeyiri» boet. <verse eid="JHN 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8"/>Bíwere «Taane itsh etre, eshe it geyrwo taana wotiyal hanotsi k'ayk'rowere, amnee» bíet. <verse eid="JHN 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9"/>Hanwere b́wot, «Nihono, taash ni'imts ashuwotsitse ikonor dab t'afiratsee» bí eteets aap'o b́ s'eenisha.<verse eid="JHN 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10"/>Smon P'et'rosu shiki gorado b́ detstsotse b́ shiko kaas' dekt kahanai naashwots guutso k'ani wazo k'ut'b́k'ri, guuts man shúútsonwere «Malkosi» b́ tesh. <verse eid="JHN 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:11 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 26:39">Mat. 26:39</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:36">Mar. 14:36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:42">Luk'. 22:42</ref> </char></note> Iyesusmó P'et'rossh, «N shiki gorado b́ batots anik'rowe, Niho taash bímts gondbek'i wanc'o úshalktaaneya?» bíet.<verse eid="JHN 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesusi kahani jamwots abaatsi naashok dek't ametsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12"/>Maniyere il wotaderwotsnat boon alefon, Ayhdiwots koti kotfwots Iyesusi detsdek't tip bok'r. <verse eid="JHN 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13"/>Shinnwere Hana maants dek't bo am, Hanwere mandúri kahaniwots abaatsi naasho teshtso K'eyafsh bí abi b́ tesh. <verse eid="JHN 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:14 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 11:49-50">11:49-50</ref> </char></note> K'eyafwere «Ik asho ash jamwots jangosh b́ k'iro k'anef» ett Ayhudi naashwotssh iztsoni b́ tesh.<verse eid="JHN 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'et'ros Iyesusi danatse bí e'to</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Mat. 26:69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Mar. 14:66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luk'. 22:55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15"/>Smon P'et'rosnat b́ daniru k'oshnton Iyesus shuutso botuu, k'osh b́ daniru man kahniwotsatsi naashoke daneeka b́ tesh, b́ danif manwere Iyesusnton kahaniwots naasho múúlots b́ kindi, <verse eid="JHN 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16"/>P'et'rosmó uratsere fengesh ganok need'dek'tni b́ tesh, kahaniwots naashoke daneets b́ danfman úromaants kesh waat fengesh kotiru baar na'ush keewt P'et'rosn kindsh b́k'r, <verse eid="JHN 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17"/>Fengsh kotiru baar naunu P'et'rossh, «Neewere ashaan danirwotsitsi iko neenosha?» biet. Bíwere taanaliye b́ eti.<verse eid="JHN 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18"/>Manoor datso ak' b́ wottsotse guutswotsnat zebi kotirwotsn itsintsiron tawo aat'idek't bokashiri. P'et'roswere bonton need'dek'tni tawa b́kashiri.<verse eid="JHN 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kahaniwots naashokere Iyesussh t'ints aato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat. 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mar. 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luk'. 22:66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19"/>Kahni naashi naasho Iyesusi b́ danifwotsnat b́daniyiru daniy jango bíaati. <verse eid="JHN 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20"/>Iyesuswere hank'o ett bísh bíaaniy, «Taaye ash jamosh sháánone t keewi, ayhudi jamwots Ik' k'onosh bokakwets mootse wotowa Ik' mootse aaw aawone tdaniyi, ááshon t keewtso ik keewo aaliye, <verse eid="JHN 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21"/>Eshe, eegoshe taan ni aatiri? Bosh t keewor shishtswotsi aatwe, taa t keewtso bo danfnee.»<verse eid="JHN 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22"/>Iyesus han b́ keewor manoke need'dek't teshtswotsitsi kotirwotsatse iko, «Kahniwots naashosh hank'oweya ni'aaniti?» ett bín b́ jabi.<verse eid="JHN 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23"/>Iyesuswere «Gondo aap're wotiyal gond keewo t keewtsk'o gawowe, t keewtso arika wotiyalmó taan eegoshe ntogiri?» bíet.<verse eid="JHN 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24"/>Maniyere il Hana, Iyesusi b́ tipetsok'on kahniwots naasho K'eyaf maants damib́k'r.<verse eid="JHN 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'et'ros aani Iyesusi danatse bíettsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Mat. 26:71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Mar. 14:69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luk'. 22:58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25"/>Manoor Simon P'et'ros need'dek't tawo b́kashfere b́ tesh, k'osh ashuwotswere «Nee ashman danifwotsitsi iko neenosha?» bo eti. Bíwere, «Taanaliye» jamere bíet.<verse eid="JHN 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26"/>P'et'ros b́ waaz b́k'ut'ts ashosh jag wottso kahni naasho guutsuwotsitse iko, «Mit bos'wots beyoke bínton neen be'atsta?» bíet.<verse eid="JHN 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27"/>P'et'rosu dab́t jamere bí eti, manoor baako b́k'adi.<verse eid="JHN 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesusi P'ilat'osok damewo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat. 27:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mar. 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk'. 23:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28"/>Maniyere il Iyesusi K'eyaf mookere Romn waats dats k'eezirwo múúlok dek't boami, manoronu guura b́ tesh. ayhudiwots fazigi baaliwosh shukeet mereero bometwotse bo kimawok'o ett datsu k'eeziru múúlots kindatsno. <verse eid="JHN 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29"/>Mansh P'ilat'os bo maantsan kesh waat, «Ashaanats it t'intsiru s'aamiyo eebi?» ett bíaati.<verse eid="JHN 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30"/>Bowere «Ashaan gondo fineraka wotink'e neesh beshide imawk'one b́ teshi» ett bo aani.<verse eid="JHN 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31"/>P'ilat'oswere «It it tookon de'amr it nemok'on angshwere» bíet.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:31">Ayhudiwotswere «No nemotse ash úd'o noosh baziyeke» boet <verse eid="JHN 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:32 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 3:14">Yoh. 3:14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:32">12:32</ref> </char></note> Manwere b́ wot Iyesus aawk'on b́ k'iritwok'o aap'ets aap'o b́ s'eenetwok'owe.<verse eid="JHN 18:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33"/>P'ilat'oswere aanat b́ múúlots b́ kindi Iyesusno s'eegt «Nee Ayhudi naasho neeneya?» ett bí aati.<verse eid="JHN 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34"/>Iyesus «Nee hań nietiŕ n tokoneyamó? t jango k'osh ashuwots neesh bokeewrneya?» bí et. <verse eid="JHN 18:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35"/>P'ilat'oswere, «Taa ayhudi taaneya? Neen taash beshidek't imtswots n jirwotsnat kahni naashwotsnee, nee eebi nk'altsoni?» bí et. <verse eid="JHN 18:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36"/>Iyesus «T mengstu datsanatskiyaliye, t mengstu datsanatsiki wotink'ere Ayhudi naashwots kishots t kindrawok'o ti ashuwots taash kes'ank'ne b́ teshi, t mengstunmó datsanatsikiyaliye» ett bíaaniy. <verse eid="JHN 18:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37"/>P'ilat'oswere «Beree nee nugús neenere?» bí eti. Iyesuswere «Taa nugus t wottsok'o neenere etiri, taa t shuwewokonat datsanats twaa ari jango gawoshee, arik wotts jamo ti aap'o k'ebetwe» ett bíaaniy.<verse eid="JHN 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38"/>P'ilat'oswere «Aro eebi?» ett bíaati. Maniyere il P'ilat'os ayhudiwots maants kesh waat hank'o bíet, «Taa bíatse ik naandunor daatsratse, <verse eid="JHN 18:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39"/>Ernmó it doyok'on fazigi bali aawor tipetswotsitse iko worwot worwoton itsh biitsfe, mansh Ayhudi nugúso itsh t bitsish geefteya?» bí eti.<verse eid="JHN 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40"/>Boomó «Berebani noosh biishe bako haniyali!» ett bokúhi. Berbanmó wombedeya b́tesh.<verse eid="JHN 18:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19"/>
  <para style="s">Kes' kes'fwots Iyesusats trgc'o bokashtsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-32">Mat. 27:27-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:15-21">Mar. 15:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1"/>Maniyere il P'ilat'os Iyesusi dek'amt b́garfii. <verse eid="JHN 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2"/>Kes'kes'fwotswere angitson k'odets akliliyo doozdek't Iyesus tookats gedbok'r, tahi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:2 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Tahi bira: </char><char style="ft">Tahi bíronwere nugúswots botahef bíronat dar aron eekdek' dozets b́gizo shaaw taha. </char></note> bironowere takbokr. <verse eid="JHN 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3"/>B́iyo waat bíats kashon, «Ayhudi nugusono! jeeno neesh wotowe!» bo etferab botesh, etonwere bín bojabi.<verse eid="JHN 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4"/>P'ilat'os aaniy uromaants kishdek't, «Hamb bíatse eegor t'afiyo t daatsrawok'o it danetwok'owa, bíne ur itsh kish k'rona» bíet. <verse eid="JHN 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5"/>Mann Iyesusi angitsi akliliyo b́ tookats gúúpdek't tahi bironowere b́ tahtsok'on ur kesht b́waa, P'ilat'oswere «Hambe ashoni!» bí eti.<verse eid="JHN 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6"/>Kahniy naashwotsnat kot kotfwotsn Iyesusi bobek'tsok'on, «Bín jirk'rowe! bín jirk'rowe!» ett bokuhi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">P'ilat'osmó «T weron eegoru naando bíyatse daatsratse, it geyiyal it de'amr jirde'ere» bí eti.<verse eid="JHN 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7"/>Ayhudiwotswere «Noo nemo detsfone, ashaan b́ tooko Ik'o naayi b́ woshtsotse no nemok'on k'ira b́k'iritiye» bo et. <verse eid="JHN 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8"/>Jam keewan b́ shishtsok'on P'ilat'os iki shat b́gutsi, <verse eid="JHN 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9"/>Múúlots kindt Iyesussh «Nee eewkneya nweyi?» ett bíaati.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:9">Iyesusmó eegor bísh aaniratse. <verse eid="JHN 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10"/>Manatse tuutson P'ilat'os «Taash keewratsneya? taa neen bitsosho wee jitosho alo t detstsok'o danatsiya?» bíet.<verse eid="JHN 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11"/>Iyesuswere «Ik'oke alo neesh imeraratse wotink'e tiatse eegor alo deshatsne b́tesh, mansh eshe taan neesh beshidek' imtso iki bog morro bíats wotitwe» bíet.<verse eid="JHN 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesusats k'iro angshetsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Mat. 27:15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Mar. 15:6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk'. 23:13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12"/>P'ilat's Iyesus keew keewan b́ shishtsok'on biishde fakshk'ro geyatni b́teshi, ayhudiwotsmó «Nee ashaan nfakshitka wotiyal Rom nugús jir neenaliye, b́ tookon nugús woshitu jamo nugúsosh b́ balangare!» etfets bokuhi.<verse eid="JHN 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13"/>P'ilat'os man b́ shishtsok'on Iyesusi uromaants kishdek't «Shúts sháána» eteets beyoke angshi jorats be b́dek'i, beyokan Ibrayist'i noon keew keewon, «Gabata» eta eteefo. <verse eid="JHN 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14"/>Fazigi baaliyosh k'an dek'i aawa b́tesh, manoronwere shirt sa'atok'oyi, manoor P'ilat'os ayhudiwotssh «Hambe it nugúsoni!» bíet. <verse eid="JHN 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15"/>Boomó, «Bín t'afiwe! Bín t'afiwe! jirk'rowe!» ett bokuhi. P'ilat'oswere, «It nugúso jiirk'rotaa?» bíet.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Kahni naashwotswere, «Rom dats nugúsoniyere okoon k'osh nugúso deshatsone!» ett bísh boaaniyi.<verse eid="JHN 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16"/>Manoor Iyesus b́ jitetwok'o P'ilat'os beshidek't b́ ími, boowere detsdek't boami.<verse eid="JHN 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus b́ jiitewok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat. 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mar. 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk'. 23:26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17"/>Maniyere okoon Iyesus b́ mask'aliyo kurdek't «Took k'ola» eteef beyok kesht bíami, beyokan Ibrayist'i nonkeew keewon, «Golgota» eteefo, <verse eid="JHN 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18"/>Manoknowere bín jitbok'ri, Iyesusi dagots geddek't bínton k'osh git ashuwotsi gironat k'anomaants jitbok'ri. <verse eid="JHN 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19"/>P'ilat'os, «Nazrettso Iyesus, Ayhudi nugúsa» etirwo guut'etso guut'dek't bí mask'aliy k'oyomand gedb́k'ri. <verse eid="JHN 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20"/>Iyesus b́ jitewoko kitok karn b́ teshtsotse, ayhudiwotsitse ayuwots guut'etsman bo nabab, guut'etsonwere b́ guut'e Ibrayist'iyon, Latiniyonat Grikiy noon keew keewok'ona b́ tesh. <verse eid="JHN 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21"/>Ayhudi kahni naashwots p'ilat'ossh, «Nee ‹Ayhudi nugúsa› err guut'k'aye, ernmó, ‹Ashaan taaye ayhudiwots nugúso taane› etfe err guud'e» boeti.<verse eid="JHN 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22"/>P'ilat'osmó, «T guut'tso guut're» ett bíaani.<verse eid="JHN 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23"/>Kes'kes'fwots Iyesusi bojiti hakon b́ taho dek't, kes'f ikosh ik ik kayo b́ bodetwok'o awdoko kayibok'r. Ernmó b́ kito hank'owa bok'al, b́ kito shiperawo dambe dek't dash b́borfetso ikon wozeka b́ tesh. <verse eid="JHN 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:24 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Dub. 22:18</ref> </char></note> Mansh kes'fwots, «It'o no sha'e bísh b́bodtso noyitse b́dek'o k'anefe bako gaat'k'ayone» bo eti. Man b́ wotwere,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">«T tahonee kaybodek'i,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">T kitatsowere it'o boshp'i»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Etirwo S'ayin mas'afitstso b́ s'eenetwok'owa, kes' kes'fwotswere mank'o bok'al.<verse eid="JHN 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25"/>Iyesus mask'aliy ganoke b́ índnat b́ índmishn, K'elyop' máátsu Mariyamnat Megdelitsu mariyamwere need'dek'tni botesh, <verse eid="JHN 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26"/>Iyesus bí indnat b́ shunf b́danifo ikoke boned'efere b́ bek'tsok'on bí índsh, «Máátsune! mambe nnaayi!» bí et.<verse eid="JHN 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27"/>Maniyere il b́ danifmansh, «Mambiye ni indi» bí et. manoori sa'aton tuzt b́ danifman b́ galomand bin dek't bíami.<verse eid="JHN 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus b́k'irtsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat. 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mar. 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk'. 23:44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:28 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PSA 69:21">Dub. 69:21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 22:15">22:15</ref> </char>
    </note> Maniyere il Iyesus and jam keewo s'een b́s'uutsok'owo dandek't S'ayn mas'fotse guut'ets Ik'i aap'o b́ s'eenetwok'o, «Shashuwere!» bíet.<verse eid="JHN 19:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29"/>Manoke biri k'ac'otse s'eent beyiru weyini shasho fa'ebtesh, mansh manoke fa'a ashuwots weyini bir shashman sponjiwok'ots gupt s'eentsdek't hisop'i mitats joddk't b́ nonats bot'intsi, <verse eid="JHN 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30"/>Iyesuswere biri shashman b́ nonots b́gedihakon «S'uuwtsere!» bí eti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:30">B́tookonowere jilk' aydek't k'iri b́wtsi.<verse eid="JHN 19:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus lalk'ots ginon koshetsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31"/>Maniyere il Ayhudi naashwots, jitets ashuwots shókó tishde'er, boduuno maskaliyatse bo orshitwok'o P'ilat'osi bok'oni, man bok'aluere eegoshe sanbati aawosh k'andek'o boosh b́geyitsotse, sanbatmanwere baaliyi een b́wottsosh, sanbati aawon boduuno mask'aliyats b́ beerawok'owa ettni. <verse eid="JHN 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32"/>Mansh kes'kes'fwots amt, Iyesusnton jiitsets ashuwotsi, shin iko shóko tiitst ando aani gitlo shóko botiitsi, <verse eid="JHN 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33"/>Iyesusok boamtsok'onmó, bí shino k'irt b́teshtsok'o bek't b́shóko tishatsno. <verse eid="JHN 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34"/>Ernmó kes'kes'fwotsitse iko, b́ lalk'ats ginon kosh b́k'ri, manoor b́ lalk'otse s'atsonat aatson b́kesh. <verse eid="JHN 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35"/>Man bek'tso it it amanituk'owo b́ gawi, b́ gawonwere arika, b́ keewirwonwere arik b́wottsok'o bí danfee. <verse eid="JHN 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:36 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 12:46">Kesh. 12:46</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 9:12">Taaw. 9:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 34:20">Dub. 34:20</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 12:10">Zek. 12:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Bek'. 1:7</ref> </char></note> Han b́wotwere, «B́ mak'tsotse dab ikonwor tisheratsee» etiru S'ayin mas'afitsi aap'o b́s'eenetwok'owe. <verse eid="JHN 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37"/>Ando k'osh S'ayin mas'aafi kayotse, «Bo koshtsmanee bek'etúnee» etfe.<verse eid="JHN 19:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesusi duketsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat. 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mar. 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk'. 23:50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38"/>Ayhudi naashwotsi shatt ááshon Iyesus danifwotsitse teshtso Armatiyas datstso Yosef Iyesus duuno dek'osh P'ilat'osi b́k'on. P'ilat'oswere de'e bíet. Mansh Yosef amt duuno k'aa'úb́dek'. <verse eid="JHN 19:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:39 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 3:1-2">Yoh. 3:1-2</ref> </char></note> Maniyere shin t'úwon Iyesusok waat teshtso Nik'odimoswere kerbewonat ekoos'on eekdek't s'aletso shaash kilok'o wotitwo dek't b́wyi. <verse eid="JHN 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40"/>Ash gitetsmanots Iyesus duuno k'aaúdek't ayhudiwots duun naap'efok'on naap't shituwonton shemi shishon t'at'bok'ri. <verse eid="JHN 19:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41"/>Iyesus jiteyat b́ teshtsoke mit bos'wots bobeyoko fa'e b́tesh, miti beyiru manitse konnor bits duk danawu doowi handro fa'e b́ tesh. <verse eid="JHN 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42"/>Sanbati jangosh k'andek'osh ett ando dowonuwere karn b́teshtsotse Iyesus duuno manok gedbok'ri.<verse eid="JHN 19:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesus k'irotse k'azb́tuutsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat. 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mar. 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk'. 24:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1"/>Torbanitsi shintso aawots, sanbata gudots, maar goyo b́ maat'fetse, Megdeli datstsu Mariyam Iyesus doowomants biami, manok b bodtsok'on doowo bin ipets shútso doowman fengeshatse k'aztuut b́ befere bek'b́k'ri. <verse eid="JHN 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2"/>Mansh bi Simon P'et'rosnat Iyesus b́ shunf b́ danifok wos'fere amaat, «Doonzo dowootse kishdek'wutsernee, aawok bogedtsok'o danatsone» bieti.<verse eid="JHN 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3"/>Manorowere P'et'rosnat b́ danif ikmann kesht dowomand boami. <verse eid="JHN 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4"/>Gitetswotswere towatni bowos'iri, ernmó b́ danif k'oshman P'et'rosiyere bogo káárt wos'fere amt shino dowok b́bodi. <verse eid="JHN 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5"/>Dashan tuumt doowots b́s'iltsok'on duuni taho manoke b́befere b́bek'i, ernmó gitsomaand kindratse. <verse eid="JHN 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6"/>Simon P'et'roswere b́shuutso waat́ doowots b́ kindi, bíwere duuno bín t'at'ets taho manoke b́ befere b́ bek'i. <verse eid="JHN 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7"/>Iyesus tooko bín s'as'ets taho b́ duuni tahonton b́ woterawo bíaali k'oshoke k'odeyat b́ beyirwok'o bek'b́k'ri. <verse eid="JHN 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8"/>Maniyere il, shin shino waabodts b́ danifman doowi gitsots kindt bek't bíamani. <verse eid="JHN 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9"/>«K'irtswotsitse tuwo geyife bísha» etts aap'o S'ayin mas'afotstso t'iwintsde'afa'no botesh. <verse eid="JHN 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10"/>Maniyere il b́ danif gitetsmanots aanat bogalomand boami.<verse eid="JHN 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus Megdel datstsu Mariyamsh b́be'etsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mat. 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Mar. 16:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11"/>Megdel dats ashu Mariyam eepfetsat, dowoniyere úratse ned'dek'atni b́tesh, eepfetsatnwere tuumdek'at doowots b́ s'iili. <verse eid="JHN 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12"/>Iyesus duuno b́ teshts beyoke nas' tah tahtdek'ts melaki gitetsuwotsi iko s'olotse iko k'oyoke bobefere bbek'i. <verse eid="JHN 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13"/>Bowere Mariyamsh, «Nee máátsune! eegishe niepiri?» boeti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:13">Biwere, «T doonzi dek'wutserne, eewk bogedtsok'onowere danatse» bíet.<verse eid="JHN 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14"/>Manowere etaat b shutsomand wongr biettsok'on Iyesus b́ need'efere bek'bk'ri, Iyesusi b́wottsok'onowere danatsane. <verse eid="JHN 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15"/>Iyesus, «Máátsune neena eegoshe niepiri, kone ngeyirwoni?» bí eti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:15">Bíwere manoki mitwotsitse finirwo bish bíartsotse, «Doonzono! nee bín dek'ri wotiyal, eewk ngedtsok'owo oona neesha taash keewwe, taa were k'aaúdek'etuwe» bieti.<verse eid="JHN 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16"/>Iyesuswere, «Mariyame!» bí eti. Biwere b́maants wongr etaat Ibrayist'i noon keewu keewon, «Rebuni!» bí eti. Man etonwere, «Danifono!» etee.<verse eid="JHN 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17"/>Iyesus, «Tiyats borr taan detsk'aye taahe andoor tnihok damb keyafa'e, ernmó tieshwotsok amr ‹Taahe ti nihnat it nihok, ti Ik'onat it Ik'ok damb bíyok keshetwe etfe› err boosh keewwe» bíet.<verse eid="JHN 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18"/>Mann Megdel datstsu Mariyam b́ danifwotsok amaat «Doonzo bek're!» etaat bish eeg bíettsok'onowere boosh b keewi.<verse eid="JHN 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus b́danifuwotsats b́be'etsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat. 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mar. 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk'. 24:36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19"/>Manoori ik gawiymanitsi shints aaw sanbata gudots kooc' b́ danifwots ayhudi naashwotsi bo shattsotse, bo maa fengesho is'dek't́ moots kakwedek'tni botesh, maa fengesho is'etsok'on b́ befere Iyesus b́ danifwots kakwed'ek't bobeyiru moots b́ kindi, bo dagots need'dek't, «Jeeno itsh wotowe!» bíet. <verse eid="JHN 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20"/>Man ett b́ kishonat b́ lalk'on boosh b́ kits, b́ danifuwotswere doonzo bobek'tsok'on geneúbowutsi. <verse eid="JHN 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21"/>Maniyere il Iyesus aaniy, «Jeeno itsh wotowe! taan niho b́ woshtsok'o taawere iti woshitwe» bíet. <verse eid="JHN 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22"/>Man eton bo aats úff ett, «S'ayin shayiro de'ere, <verse eid="JHN 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:23 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 16:19">Mat. 16:19</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:18">18:18</ref> </char></note> ashuwots morrosh orowe it etal boosh bo morro orowa etetuwe, it ashuwots morro orowa eto it k'azal boosh orowa eteeratse» bíet.<verse eid="JHN 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesusnat Tomaasn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24"/>Iyesus b́ danifwotsok b́ woor tatse gitetsuwotsitse iko, Didimosi eteefo Tomas bowoke aali b́tesh. <verse eid="JHN 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25"/>Mansh b́ danif k'oshuwots Tomassh «Doonzone bek'rone» boet. Bímó «Mismaron koshets b́ kishuwotsi be'er tjabuwotsi msmaron koshets manotsits tgerawo, t kishonowere b́ lalk'i gaawots t gedala bako b́jamon amaneratse» bí eti.<verse eid="JHN 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26"/>Shimt aawoniyere hakon b́danfuwots aaniy mootsna botesh, Tomasuwere bontini b́tesh, maa fengesho is'etsok'on b́befere Iyesus waa bo dagotse need'dek't́, «Jeeno itsh wotowe!» bíet. <verse eid="JHN 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27"/>Maniyere il Tomassh, «N jaabo hakan doyir tkishwotsi s'iile, nkishonowere dewar t lalk'ots geere, amantso wotowe bako, amanerawo wotk'aye» bí et.<verse eid="JHN 20:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28"/>Tomaswere, «T doonzo! tiko Izar Izewero!» ett bísh bíaani.<verse eid="JHN 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29"/>Iyesuswere Tomassh, «Neyere taan nbek'tsosha taan niamaniye, taan bo be aawon taan amanituwots údeknee» bíet.<verse eid="JHN 20:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mas'aafan eegosh b́guut'etsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30"/>Iyesus mas'afanitse guut't gederawo k'osh ay aditso b́ danifúwots shinatse finere, <verse eid="JHN 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31"/>Ernmó Iyesus Krstos Ik'o naayi b́wottsok'owo it amanituwok'o, amanar b́shutson dúre dúri kasho it datsitwok'owa han b́ guut'iyi.<verse eid="JHN 20:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesus b́danif shawatuwotssh b́be'etsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1"/>Haniyere okoon Iyesus T'bryados aats k'ari<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:1 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">T'bryos aats k'ara: </char><char style="ft">Nat Gelil aats kaaron ikne. </char></note> ganoke, b́ danifwotssh aaniy b́be'eyi, b́ be'ewwere hank'owa, <verse eid="JHN 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2"/>Sim'on P'et'rosi, Didimosi eteefo Tomasi, K'aan Galil datstso Natnaeli, Zebdiwos nana'wotsnat b́ danif gitetswots towatni botesh. <verse eid="JHN 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:3 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 5:5">Luk'. 5:5</ref> </char></note> Sim'on P'et'ros, «Mus' detso amna» bíet.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:3">Bowere, «Nentoniye no ameti» boet. Kesh amt jelbots bokind, ernmó manots t'ú mus' iku dab deshatsno. <verse eid="JHN 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4"/>B́gatstsok'on Iyesus aats k'ari gúúrats ned'b́wts, b́ danifwotsimó Iyesusi b́wottsok'o danatsno. <verse eid="JHN 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5"/>Iyesuswere, «Nana'otso! mus' iku detsfte?» bí eti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:5">Bowere, «Ik biidu dab deshatsone» boeti.<verse eid="JHN 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:6 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="LUK 5:6">Luk'. 5:6</ref> </char>
    </note> Bíwere, «Mus'i kambo jelbu k'anomaants shau'ere daatsitute» bíet. Mansh kambo aats k'arots shap' bok'ri, mus'o ayo bodetstsatse tuutson kambo geetso maawbowtsi.<verse eid="JHN 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7"/>Manoor Iyesus b́shunf b́danfo P'et'rossh, «Bíye doonzoniye!» bíet. Sim'on P'et'ros, «Doonzoniyosha» eto b́shishtsok'on finosha ett b́ kito kisht b́teshtsotse manoor tahdek't aats k'arots t'oolat b́kindi. <verse eid="JHN 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8"/>B́ danifwotsmó datsatse git bal indoniyere bowokerawotse mus'o bíns'ents mus'i kambo geetsfere jelbon boweyi. <verse eid="JHN 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9"/>Jelbotse bo oot'tsok'on bí abaatse mus'o detstso itsintsiri tawik'ak'onat misho bek'bok'ri. <verse eid="JHN 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10"/>Iyesuswere, «And it detsts mus'otse dewere» bíet.<verse eid="JHN 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11"/>Mansh Simon P'et'ros jelbots t'oolat kindon balebalk'atse keez mus'i een eenwots bítse bos'eents mus'i kambo datsomand b́getsi, mank'o mus'i ay b́ detsalor mus'i kambman gaad'eratse. <verse eid="JHN 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12"/>Iyesus maniyere il, «Waa moore» bíet. Boúnets doonzo Iyesusi b́ wottsok'o dant boteshtsotse b́ danifwotsitse dab́ ikonwor, «Kone nee?» ett aatosh aawo shuuk'tso aali. <verse eid="JHN 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13"/>Mann Iyesus waat, mishonat mus'on k'aaúdek't b́ími.<verse eid="JHN 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14"/>Iyesus k'irotse b́ tuwihakon b́ danifuwots bín bobek'irwan keezla b́tesh.<verse eid="JHN 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus P'et'rosi bíaat aato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15"/>Guur misho bomeyihakon Iyesus Sim'on P'et'rossh, «Yona naay Sim'ono! hanots taan bo shunirwoniyere bogo taan shunfiy?» bíet. Bíwere «Ee, t doonzo! taa neen tshuntsok'o neewor danfnee» ett bísh bíaaniy. Iyesuswere «T mereer buk'ulwotsi maanzwe» bíet. <verse eid="JHN 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16"/>Aaniy gitlo «Yona naay Sim'ono! taan shunfiya» bíet. Bíwere «Ee t doonzo! neen tshutsok'o nee danfnee» bíet. Iyesuswere «T mereer nana'úwotsi kore» bíet. <verse eid="JHN 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17"/>Keezlonowere «Yona naay Sim'ono! taan shunfiya?» bíet. Keezlo «Taan shunfiya» bíetsosh P'et'ros shiyanwtsat «Doonozono! Nee úno danfnee, taa neen tshunok'onowere danfnee» bíet. Iyesuswere hank'o bísh bíet, «T mererwotsi jinee <verse eid="JHN 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18"/>Arikon, arikoniye, neesh ti etiry nee jawetson nbeyor ni edo n kishon edde'er nshuntsok niamfoni nteshi, ni enashormó nee n kishuwotsi njargre k'osh asho neesh bíediti, nshunawokowere neen debíameti.» <verse eid="JHN 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19"/>Han bíetuwere P'et'ros aawk'o k'iron Ik'o mangiyo bísh b́geyitwok'o kitsosha b́tesh, Maniyere il P'et'rossh «T shuutso shoydewowe!» bíet.<verse eid="JHN 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesusnat b́danif k'oshon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20"/>P'et'ros wongr ett Iyesus b́ shunf danifo b́ shuutso b́ wafere b́ bek'i, b́ danif han kooc'mishor Iyesusok t'iindek't, «Doonzono, neen beshide imetwo kone?» ett aattsoni b́ tesh. <verse eid="JHN 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21"/>P'et'ros bín bek't, «Doonzono! ashaanmó aawk'owe b́ wotiti?» ett Iyesusi bíaati.<verse eid="JHN 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22"/>Iyesuswere «T wafetsosh s'ker beewe tietal neen eege gedi? Neehe t shuutso shoydewowe!» bíet.<verse eid="JHN 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23"/>Manatse tuutson eshwots dagotse «B́ danifman k'irratse» etts keewo shisheb́wts. Ernmó Iyesus «T wafetsosh beewe tietal neen bíts eege gedi» eta bíetibako «K'irratse» eraatse. <verse eid="JHN 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24"/>Keewanots jangosh jamon gawtsonat keewanotsnowere guut'tso b́ danifo, b́ gawts gawonwere ar b́wottsok'o danfone.<verse eid="JHN 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25"/>Iyesus b́ k'altswots k'osh ay keewwots fa'ano botesh. Taash bíartsok'owosh bí b́ fints keew jamwots ik ikon boguut'eyink'ere guut'ets mas'aafwotsi datso b́tookon kuro falrawnk'e b́tesh.<verse eid="JHN 21:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21"/>
</usx>
